   <p>Comprehensive planning across structural foundations, spatial partitioning, durable surfaces, and critical water and power infrastructure.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"civil-blueprint anim-base anim-fade-up delay-100\">\r\n      <!-- Top Row: 01 & 02 -->\r\n      <div class=\"cb-row-top\">\r\n        <!-- 01. Foundation & Structural Development -->\r\n        <article class=\"cb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"cb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"cb-num-pill\">01. Foundation &amp; Structure</span>\r\n            <span class=\"cb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-hard-hat\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"cb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Foundation &amp; Structural Development</h3>\r\n            <p>We focus on essential foundation and structural requirements to support the stability, strength, and long-term functionality of your hospitality establishment.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 02. Walls & Space Development -->\r\n        <article class=\"cb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"cb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"cb-num-pill\">02. Walls &amp; Space Development</span>\r\n            <span class=\"cb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-border-all\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"cb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Walls &amp; Space Development</h3>\r\n            <p>We consider wall construction, partitions, and internal space development to establish practical layouts that complement the overall outlet design.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Bottom Row: 03, 04 & 05 -->\r\n      <div class=\"cb-row-bottom\">\r\n        <!-- 03. Flooring & Surface Development -->\r\n        <article class=\"cb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"cb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"cb-num-pill\">03. Flooring &amp; Surfaces</span>\r\n            <span class=\"cb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-layer-group\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"cb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Flooring &amp; Surface Development</h3>\r\n            <p>We consider suitable flooring and surface requirements based on the functional needs of different areas, including dining spaces, kitchens, and service zones.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 04. Plumbing & Water Systems -->\r\n        <article class=\"cb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"cb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"cb-num-pill\">04. Plumbing &amp; Water</span>\r\n            <span class=\"cb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-tint\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"cb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Plumbing &amp; Water Systems</h3>\r\n            <p>We focus on essential plumbing requirements, water supply arrangements, drainage, and sanitation infrastructure to support smooth daily operations.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 05. Electrical Infrastructure -->\r\n        <article class=\"cb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"cb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"cb-num-pill\">05. Electrical Systems</span>\r\n            <span class=\"cb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-bolt\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"cb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Electrical Infrastructure</h3>\r\n            <p>We consider electrical layouts, power requirements, lighting provisions, and essential electrical systems to accommodate kitchen equipment and other operational needs.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 3: OUR APPROACH TO CIVIL WORK (LIGHT SLATE-BLUE TINT #EDF2F8 - 4 CARDS) -->\r\n<section class=\"approach-sec\" id=\"civil-approach\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"head-center anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Our Process</span>\r\n      <h2>Our Approach to Civil Work.</h2>\r\n      <p>A disciplined four-stage process to plan, coordinate, and verify essential structural and utility infrastructure for your hospitality space.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"approach-grid\">\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-100\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-clipboard-list\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Understanding Project Requirements</h3>\r\n        <p>We begin by understanding your hospitality concept, building requirements, available space, and essential infrastructure needs.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-200\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-drafting-compass\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Planning Structural Requirements</h3>\r\n        <p>We identify key civil work requirements, including foundations, walls, flooring, plumbing, and electrical provisions.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-300\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-tasks\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Coordinating Development Activities</h3>\r\n        <p>We focus on coordinating the various development requirements to ensure that structural and infrastructure work aligns with the overall project plan.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-400\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-double\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Supporting Functional Readiness</h3>\r\n        <p>We consider the final infrastructure requirements to help ensure that the developed space is suitable for its intended hospitality operations.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 4: CTA (WARM GOLD CHAMPAGNE #EFE3C6) -->\r\n<section class=\"cta\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap cta-inner anim-base anim-zoom-in\">\r\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\">Let\'s Build the Foundation for Your Next Hospitality Venture.</span>\r\n    <h2>Strong Foundations. Better Hospitality Spaces.</h2>\r\n    <p>The success of a hospitality business depends not only on what guests see but also on the infrastructure that supports everything behind the scenes.</p>\r\n    <p>Let Artha Hospitality Management help you develop well-planned hospitality spaces with strong foundations and essential infrastructure designed around your business needs.</p>\r\n    <div class=\"cta-btns\">\r\n      <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/contact-us\" class=\"btn btn-light\">Partner With Artha <span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a>\r\n      <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/contact-us#contact-form-section\" class=\"btn btn-outline-light\">Get in Touch</a>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n</article>', 'Civil Work', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '34-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-11-26 09:43:24', '2026-11-26 09:43:24', '', 34, 'http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/?p=37', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES(38, 1, '2026-11-26 09:47:59', '2026-11-26 09:47:59', '<article>\r\n<!-- NEW 75VH COST ALLOCATION RING, STEPPED EFFICIENCY BARS & CULINARY LEDGER HERO SECTION -->\r\n<section class=\"cost-hero\" id=\"cost-top\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap cost-hero-grid\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- Left Column: Editorial Copy & CTAs -->\r\n    <div class=\"cost-hero-copy anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <div class=\"service-meta-row\">\r\n        <nav class=\"crumb-badge\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\r\n          <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/\">Home</a>\r\n          <span class=\"sep\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i></span>\r\n          <a href=\"#\">Services</a>\r\n          <span class=\"sep\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i></span>\r\n          <span class=\"curr\">Food &amp; Running Cost</span>\r\n        </nav>\r\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">Cost Control &amp; Efficiency</span>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <h1>Managing Costs. <em>Maximising Operational Efficiency.</em></h1>\r\n      <p>Managing expenses is essential to running a profitable and sustainable hospitality business. At Artha Hospitality Management, we help hospitality businesses understand, monitor, and manage their food costs and day-to-day operating expenses.</p>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"cost-hero-actions\">\r\n        <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/contact-us\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Partner With Artha <span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a>\r\n        <a href=\"#focus-areas\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Our Cost Focus Areas</a>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Right Column: Segmented Cost-Allocation Ring, Stepped Bar Columns & Culinary Ledger Window (No Text) -->\r\n    <div class=\"cost-ledger-stage anim-base anim-fade-left delay-100\">\r\n      <!-- Segmented Donut Cost Allocation Ring SVG -->\r\n      <svg class=\"cl-ring-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 180\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"90\" r=\"68\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"18\" />\r\n        <circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"90\" r=\"68\" stroke=\"#1A1718\" stroke-width=\"12\" stroke-dasharray=\"160 270\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" />\r\n        <circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"90\" r=\"68\" stroke=\"#C4161C\" stroke-width=\"12\" stroke-dasharray=\"115 315\" stroke-dashoffset=\"-175\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" />\r\n        <circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"90\" r=\"50\" stroke=\"#C4161C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\" opacity=\"0.7\" />\r\n      </svg>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Central Balance Scale Medallion Inside Donut Ring -->\r\n      <div class=\"cl-scale-node\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <i class=\"fas fa-balance-scale\"></i>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Ascending 4-Column Efficiency Bars on Right Edge -->\r\n      <div class=\"cl-bar-columns\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <span class=\"cl-bar b1\"></span>\r\n        <span class=\"cl-bar b2\"></span>\r\n        <span class=\"cl-bar b3\"></span>\r\n        <span class=\"cl-bar b4\"></span>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"cl-wireframe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Main Sculpted Culinary & Operations Image Frame -->\r\n      <div class=\"cl-main-frame\">\r\n        <figure class=\"cr-figure\">\r\n          <img src=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/wp-content/themes/artha-child-theme/assets/images/artha-hospitality-food-and-running-cost-hero.jpg\" alt=\"Well-managed hospitality dining and kitchen operations\" loading=\"eager\">\r\n          <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">Well-managed hospitality dining and kitchen operations</figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- 3-Icon Expense Control Dock (Food, Inventory, Utilities - Icons Only, No Text) -->\r\n      <div class=\"cl-expense-dock\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <span><i class=\"fas fa-utensils\"></i></span>\r\n        <span><i class=\"fas fa-boxes\"></i></span>\r\n        <span><i class=\"fas fa-bolt\"></i></span>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 1: BETTER COST MANAGEMENT FOR SUSTAINABLE GROWTH (OFFWHITE) -->\r\n<section class=\"cost-overview-sec\" id=\"cost-overview\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap overview-split\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"overview-copy anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Financial Discipline &amp; Quality</span>\r\n      <h2>Better Cost Management for <em>Sustainable Growth.</em></h2>\r\n      <p>In the hospitality industry, even small variations in daily expenses can have a significant impact on overall profitability. Uncontrolled ingredient usage, inefficient resource consumption, and poorly managed operating expenses can gradually affect business performance.</p>\r\n      <p>Whether you operate a restaurant, café, hotel, or resto-bar, we help bring greater visibility and structure to your everyday expenses, enabling you to maintain better cost control while delivering consistent service and quality.</p>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"cost-callout\">\r\n        <span>Balanced Financial Decisions</span>\r\n        <p>“From ingredient procurement and food usage to staff salaries, utilities, and daily operational expenditure, we focus on identifying cost factors and supporting better financial decisions without compromising food quality or guest experience.”</p>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Right Column: Single Image with Shapes (No Text) -->\r\n    <div class=\"overview-arch-stage anim-base anim-fade-left delay-100\">\r\n      <svg class=\"oas-rings-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 220\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#C4161C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"98\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 6\" opacity=\"0.55\" />\r\n        <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"70\" opacity=\"0.65\" />\r\n      </svg>\r\n      <div class=\"oas-navy-slab\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"oas-wireframe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"oas-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"oas-backdrop-img\">\r\n        <figure class=\"cr-figure\">\r\n          <img src=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/wp-content/themes/artha-child-theme/assets/images/artha-hospitality-capital-inverstments-content-1.jpg\" alt=\"Structured hospitality cost management and operational efficiency\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n          <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">Structured hospitality cost management and operational efficiency</figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 2: OUR COST MANAGEMENT FOCUS AREAS (DEEP ARCHITECTURAL NAVY #0D2244 - 5-ZONE BLUEPRINT MATRIX) -->\r\n<section class=\"cost-focus-sec\" id=\"focus-areas\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"head-center anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Key Expenditure Pillars</span>\r\n      <h2>Our Cost Management Focus Areas.</h2>\r\n      <p>Bringing structured visibility and practical controls across food costs, inventory, workforce, utilities, and daily operations.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"cost-blueprint anim-base anim-fade-up delay-100\">\r\n      <!-- Top Row: 01 & 02 -->\r\n      <div class=\"cb-row-top\">\r\n        <!-- 01. Food Cost Monitoring -->\r\n        <article class=\"cb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"cb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"cb-num-pill\">01. Food Cost Monitoring</span>\r\n            <span class=\"cb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-utensils\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"cb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Food Cost Monitoring</h3>\r\n            <p>We focus on monitoring ingredient expenses, food usage, and overall food costs to help maintain a better balance between product quality and profitability.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 02. Ingredient & Inventory Management -->\r\n        <article class=\"cb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"cb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"cb-num-pill\">02. Ingredient &amp; Inventory</span>\r\n            <span class=\"cb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-boxes\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"cb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Ingredient &amp; Inventory Management</h3>\r\n            <p>We encourage systematic ingredient planning, purchasing, and inventory monitoring to minimise unnecessary spending, reduce wastage, and support efficient stock utilisation.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Bottom Row: 03, 04 & 05 -->\r\n      <div class=\"cb-row-bottom\">\r\n        <!-- 03. Staff Cost Management -->\r\n        <article class=\"cb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"cb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"cb-num-pill\">03. Staff Cost Management</span>\r\n            <span class=\"cb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-users-cog\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"cb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Staff Cost Management</h3>\r\n            <p>We help assess staffing requirements, salary expenses, and workforce allocation to support effective manpower utilisation and balanced operating costs.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 04. Utility & Resource Management -->\r\n        <article class=\"cb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"cb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"cb-num-pill\">04. Utility &amp; Resources</span>\r\n            <span class=\"cb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-bolt\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"cb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Utility &amp; Resource Management</h3>\r\n            <p>We consider everyday utility expenses, including electricity, water, gas, and other essential resources, while identifying opportunities for more efficient consumption.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 05. Daily Operating Expense Control -->\r\n        <article class=\"cb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"cb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"cb-num-pill\">05. Daily Operating Expenses</span>\r\n            <span class=\"cb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-file-invoice-dollar\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"cb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Daily Operating Expense Control</h3>\r\n            <p>We focus on understanding recurring operational expenses, tracking expenditure, and encouraging practical cost management practices that support the financial health of your business.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 3: OUR APPROACH TO COST MANAGEMENT (LIGHT SLATE-BLUE TINT #EDF2F8 - 4 CARDS) -->\r\n<section class=\"approach-sec\" id=\"cost-approach\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"head-center anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Our Process</span>\r\n      <h2>Our Approach to Cost Management.</h2>\r\n      <p>A disciplined four-step methodology to evaluate expenditure, reduce wastage, and protect long-term hospitality margins.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"approach-grid\">\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-100\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-search-dollar\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Understanding Your Expenses</h3>\r\n        <p>We begin by understanding your business operations, food requirements, staffing structure, and recurring operating expenses.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-200\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-clipboard-list\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Evaluating Cost Factors</h3>\r\n        <p>We examine key expenditure areas, including ingredients, inventory, staff salaries, utilities, and other daily operational requirements.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-300\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-sliders-h\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Identifying Improvement Opportunities</h3>\r\n        <p>We identify areas where better planning, resource utilisation, and expense management practices can help minimise unnecessary costs.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-400\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-chart-line\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Supporting Continuous Cost Control</h3>\r\n        <p>We encourage consistent monitoring and practical cost management practices to help maintain operational efficiency and support long-term profitability.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 4: CTA (WARM GOLD CHAMPAGNE #EFE3C6) -->\r\n<section class=\"cta\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap cta-inner anim-base anim-zoom-in\">\r\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\">Let\'s Make Your Hospitality Business More Cost-Efficient.</span>\r\n    <h2>Control Costs. Strengthen Your Business.</h2>\r\n    <p>A successful hospitality business is built not only on attracting customers but also on managing expenses effectively. Better visibility into food and running costs helps you make informed decisions, improve operational efficiency, and build a more sustainable business.</p>\r\n    <p>Let Artha Hospitality Management help you bring structure, discipline, and efficiency to your everyday operations.</p>\r\n    <div class=\"cta-btns\">\r\n      <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/contact-us\" class=\"btn btn-light\">Partner With Artha <span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a>\r\n      <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/contact-us#contact-form-section\" class=\"btn btn-outline-light\">Get in Touch</a>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n</article>', 'Food and Running Cost', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'food-and-running-cost', '', '', '2026-11-26 09:48:07', '2026-11-26 09:48:07', '', 0, 'http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/?page_id=38', 0, 'page', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES(39, 1, '2026-11-26 09:47:59', '2026-11-26 09:47:59', '<article>\r\n<!-- NEW 75VH COST ALLOCATION RING, STEPPED EFFICIENCY BARS & CULINARY LEDGER HERO SECTION -->\r\n<section class=\"cost-hero\" id=\"cost-top\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap cost-hero-grid\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- Left Column: Editorial Copy & CTAs -->\r\n    <div class=\"cost-hero-copy anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <div class=\"service-meta-row\">\r\n        <nav class=\"crumb-badge\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\r\n          <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/\">Home</a>\r\n          <span class=\"sep\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i></span>\r\n          <a href=\"#\">Services</a>\r\n          <span class=\"sep\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i></span>\r\n          <span class=\"curr\">Food &amp; Running Cost</span>\r\n        </nav>\r\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">Cost Control &amp; Efficiency</span>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <h1>Managing Costs. <em>Maximising Operational Efficiency.</em></h1>\r\n      <p>Managing expenses is essential to running a profitable and sustainable hospitality business. At Artha Hospitality Management, we help hospitality businesses understand, monitor, and manage their food costs and day-to-day operating expenses.</p>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"cost-hero-actions\">\r\n        <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/contact-us\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Partner With Artha <span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a>\r\n        <a href=\"#focus-areas\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Our Cost Focus Areas</a>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Right Column: Segmented Cost-Allocation Ring, Stepped Bar Columns & Culinary Ledger Window (No Text) -->\r\n    <div class=\"cost-ledger-stage anim-base anim-fade-left delay-100\">\r\n      <!-- Segmented Donut Cost Allocation Ring SVG -->\r\n      <svg class=\"cl-ring-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 180 180\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"90\" r=\"68\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"18\" />\r\n        <circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"90\" r=\"68\" stroke=\"#1A1718\" stroke-width=\"12\" stroke-dasharray=\"160 270\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" />\r\n        <circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"90\" r=\"68\" stroke=\"#C4161C\" stroke-width=\"12\" stroke-dasharray=\"115 315\" stroke-dashoffset=\"-175\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" />\r\n        <circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"90\" r=\"50\" stroke=\"#C4161C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\" opacity=\"0.7\" />\r\n      </svg>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Central Balance Scale Medallion Inside Donut Ring -->\r\n      <div class=\"cl-scale-node\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <i class=\"fas fa-balance-scale\"></i>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Ascending 4-Column Efficiency Bars on Right Edge -->\r\n      <div class=\"cl-bar-columns\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <span class=\"cl-bar b1\"></span>\r\n        <span class=\"cl-bar b2\"></span>\r\n        <span class=\"cl-bar b3\"></span>\r\n        <span class=\"cl-bar b4\"></span>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"cl-wireframe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Main Sculpted Culinary & Operations Image Frame -->\r\n      <div class=\"cl-main-frame\">\r\n        <figure class=\"cr-figure\">\r\n          <img src=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/wp-content/themes/artha-child-theme/assets/images/artha-hospitality-food-and-running-cost-hero.jpg\" alt=\"Well-managed hospitality dining and kitchen operations\" loading=\"eager\">\r\n          <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">Well-managed hospitality dining and kitchen operations</figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- 3-Icon Expense Control Dock (Food, Inventory, Utilities - Icons Only, No Text) -->\r\n      <div class=\"cl-expense-dock\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <span><i class=\"fas fa-utensils\"></i></span>\r\n        <span><i class=\"fas fa-boxes\"></i></span>\r\n        <span><i class=\"fas fa-bolt\"></i></span>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 1: BETTER COST MANAGEMENT FOR SUSTAINABLE GROWTH (OFFWHITE) -->\r\n<section class=\"cost-overview-sec\" id=\"cost-overview\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap overview-split\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"overview-copy anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Financial Discipline &amp; Quality</span>\r\n      <h2>Better Cost Management for <em>Sustainable Growth.</em></h2>\r\n      <p>In the hospitality industry, even small variations in daily expenses can have a significant impact on overall profitability. Uncontrolled ingredient usage, inefficient resource consumption, and poorly managed operating expenses can gradually affect business performance.</p>\r\n      <p>Whether you operate a restaurant, café, hotel, or resto-bar, we help bring greater visibility and structure to your everyday expenses, enabling you to maintain better cost control while delivering consistent service and quality.</p>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"cost-callout\">\r\n        <span>Balanced Financial Decisions</span>\r\n        <p>“From ingredient procurement and food usage to staff salaries, utilities, and daily operational expenditure, we focus on identifying cost factors and supporting better financial decisions without compromising food quality or guest experience.”</p>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Right Column: Single Image with Shapes (No Text) -->\r\n    <div class=\"overview-arch-stage anim-base anim-fade-left delay-100\">\r\n      <svg class=\"oas-rings-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 220\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#C4161C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"98\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 6\" opacity=\"0.55\" />\r\n        <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"70\" opacity=\"0.65\" />\r\n      </svg>\r\n      <div class=\"oas-navy-slab\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"oas-wireframe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"oas-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"oas-backdrop-img\">\r\n        <figure class=\"cr-figure\">\r\n          <img src=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/wp-content/themes/artha-child-theme/assets/images/artha-hospitality-capital-inverstments-content-1.jpg\" alt=\"Structured hospitality cost management and operational efficiency\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n          <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">Structured hospitality cost management and operational efficiency</figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 2: OUR COST MANAGEMENT FOCUS AREAS (DEEP ARCHITECTURAL NAVY #0D2244 - 5-ZONE BLUEPRINT MATRIX) -->\r\n<section class=\"cost-focus-sec\" id=\"focus-areas\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"head-center anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Key Expenditure Pillars</span>\r\n      <h2>Our Cost Management Focus Areas.</h2>\r\n      <p>Bringing structured visibility and practical controls across food costs, inventory, workforce, utilities, and daily operations.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"cost-blueprint anim-base anim-fade-up delay-100\">\r\n      <!-- Top Row: 01 & 02 -->\r\n      <div class=\"cb-row-top\">\r\n        <!-- 01. Food Cost Monitoring -->\r\n        <article class=\"cb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"cb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"cb-num-pill\">01. Food Cost Monitoring</span>\r\n            <span class=\"cb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-utensils\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"cb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Food Cost Monitoring</h3>\r\n            <p>We focus on monitoring ingredient expenses, food usage, and overall food costs to help maintain a better balance between product quality and profitability.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 02. Ingredient & Inventory Management -->\r\n        <article class=\"cb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"cb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"cb-num-pill\">02. Ingredient &amp; Inventory</span>\r\n            <span class=\"cb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-boxes\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"cb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Ingredient &amp; Inventory Management</h3>\r\n            <p>We encourage systematic ingredient planning, purchasing, and inventory monitoring to minimise unnecessary spending, reduce wastage, and support efficient stock utilisation.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Bottom Row: 03, 04 & 05 -->\r\n      <div class=\"cb-row-bottom\">\r\n        <!-- 03. Staff Cost Management -->\r\n        <article class=\"cb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"cb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"cb-num-pill\">03. Staff Cost Management</span>\r\n            <span class=\"cb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-users-cog\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"cb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Staff Cost Management</h3>\r\n            <p>We help assess staffing requirements, salary expenses, and workforce allocation to support effective manpower utilisation and balanced operating costs.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 04. Utility & Resource Management -->\r\n        <article class=\"cb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"cb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"cb-num-pill\">04. Utility &amp; Resources</span>\r\n            <span class=\"cb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-bolt\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"cb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Utility &amp; Resource Management</h3>\r\n            <p>We consider everyday utility expenses, including electricity, water, gas, and other essential resources, while identifying opportunities for more efficient consumption.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 05. Daily Operating Expense Control -->\r\n        <article class=\"cb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"cb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"cb-num-pill\">05. Daily Operating Expenses</span>\r\n            <span class=\"cb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-file-invoice-dollar\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"cb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Daily Operating Expense Control</h3>\r\n            <p>We focus on understanding recurring operational expenses, tracking expenditure, and encouraging practical cost management practices that support the financial health of your business.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 3: OUR APPROACH TO COST MANAGEMENT (LIGHT SLATE-BLUE TINT #EDF2F8 - 4 CARDS) -->\r\n<section class=\"approach-sec\" id=\"cost-approach\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"head-center anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Our Process</span>\r\n      <h2>Our Approach to Cost Management.</h2>\r\n      <p>A disciplined four-step methodology to evaluate expenditure, reduce wastage, and protect long-term hospitality margins.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"approach-grid\">\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-100\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-search-dollar\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Understanding Your Expenses</h3>\r\n        <p>We begin by understanding your business operations, food requirements, staffing structure, and recurring operating expenses.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-200\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-clipboard-list\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Evaluating Cost Factors</h3>\r\n        <p>We examine key expenditure areas, including ingredients, inventory, staff salaries, utilities, and other daily operational requirements.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-300\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-sliders-h\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Identifying Improvement Opportunities</h3>\r\n        <p>We identify areas where better planning, resource utilisation, and expense management practices can help minimise unnecessary costs.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-400\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-chart-line\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Supporting Continuous Cost Control</h3>\r\n        <p>We encourage consistent monitoring and practical cost management practices to help maintain operational efficiency and support long-term profitability.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 4: CTA (WARM GOLD CHAMPAGNE #EFE3C6) -->\r\n<section class=\"cta\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap cta-inner anim-base anim-zoom-in\">\r\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\">Let\'s Make Your Hospitality Business More Cost-Efficient.</span>\r\n    <h2>Control Costs. Strengthen Your Business.</h2>\r\n    <p>A successful hospitality business is built not only on attracting customers but also on managing expenses effectively. Better visibility into food and running costs helps you make informed decisions, improve operational efficiency, and build a more sustainable business.</p>\r\n    <p>Let Artha Hospitality Management help you bring structure, discipline, and efficiency to your everyday operations.</p>\r\n    <div class=\"cta-btns\">\r\n      <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/contact-us\" class=\"btn btn-light\">Partner With Artha <span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a>\r\n      <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/contact-us#contact-form-section\" class=\"btn btn-outline-light\">Get in Touch</a>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n</article>', 'Food and Running Cost', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '38-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-11-26 09:47:59', '2026-11-26 09:47:59', '', 38, 'http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/?p=39', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES(40, 1, '2026-11-26 09:51:06', '2026-11-26 09:51:06', '<article>\r\n<!-- NEW 75VH CULINARY CLOCHE MEDALLION, 5-STAR CONSTELLATION & HOSPITALITY EXCELLENCE HERO SECTION -->\r\n<section class=\"quality-hero\" id=\"quality-top\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap quality-hero-grid\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- Left Column: Editorial Copy & CTAs -->\r\n    <div class=\"quality-hero-copy anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <div class=\"service-meta-row\">\r\n        <nav class=\"crumb-badge\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\r\n          <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management\">Home</a>\r\n          <span class=\"sep\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i></span>\r\n          <a href=\"#\">Services</a>\r\n          <span class=\"sep\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i></span>\r\n          <span class=\"curr\">Food &amp; Service Quality</span>\r\n        </nav>\r\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">Culinary &amp; Service Standards</span>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <h1>Excellence in Every Dish. <em>Exceptional Service in Every Experience.</em></h1>\r\n      <p>Quality is at the heart of every successful hospitality business. At Artha Hospitality Management, we focus on maintaining high standards of food quality, presentation, and customer service to create memorable guest experiences.</p>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"quality-hero-actions\">\r\n        <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/contact-us\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Partner With Artha <span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a>\r\n        <a href=\"#focus-areas\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Our Quality Focus Areas</a>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Right Column: Culinary Cloche Rim Stage, Award Crest & 5-Star Constellation (No Text) -->\r\n    <div class=\"quality-crest-stage anim-base anim-fade-left delay-100\">\r\n      <svg class=\"qc-rim-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 240 240\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#C4161C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"120\" r=\"108\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 6\" opacity=\"0.5\" />\r\n        <circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"120\" r=\"82\" opacity=\"0.65\" />\r\n        <circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"120\" r=\"56\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 5\" opacity=\"0.75\" />\r\n      </svg>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"qc-navy-platter\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"qc-wireframe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Main Sculpted Culinary Cloche Window -->\r\n      <div class=\"qc-main-frame\">\r\n        <figure class=\"cr-figure\">\r\n          <img src=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/wp-content/themes/artha-child-theme/assets/images/artha-hospitality-food-service-quality-hero.jpg\" alt=\"Refined culinary presentation and attentive hospitality service\" loading=\"eager\">\r\n          <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">Refined culinary presentation and attentive hospitality service</figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Gold Award Excellence Seal (Top-Right, Icon Only) -->\r\n      <div class=\"qc-award-seal\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <i class=\"fas fa-award\"></i>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- 5-Star Service Quality Constellation Dock (Bottom-Left, Icons Only, No Text) -->\r\n      <div class=\"qc-star-constellation\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <i class=\"fas fa-star\"></i>\r\n        <i class=\"fas fa-star\"></i>\r\n        <i class=\"fas fa-star\"></i>\r\n        <i class=\"fas fa-star\"></i>\r\n        <i class=\"fas fa-star\"></i>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 1: CREATING EXPERIENCES GUESTS WANT TO RETURN TO (OFFWHITE) -->\r\n<section class=\"quality-overview-sec\" id=\"quality-overview\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap overview-split\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"overview-copy anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Trust &amp; Guest Loyalty</span>\r\n      <h2>Creating Experiences Guests <em>Want to Return To.</em></h2>\r\n      <p>A great hospitality experience goes beyond serving good food. It combines consistent taste, appealing presentation, attentive service, and an environment where guests feel valued.</p>\r\n      <p>Whether you operate a restaurant, café, hotel, or resto-bar, we help you focus on the essential elements of food and service quality that influence customer perceptions, build trust, and encourage repeat visits.</p>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"quality-callout\">\r\n        <span>Standards That Build Satisfaction</span>\r\n        <p>“From consistency in taste and food presentation to professional service practices and guest interaction, we help hospitality businesses establish standards that strengthen customer satisfaction and encourage lasting loyalty.”</p>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Right Column: Single Image with Shapes (No Text) -->\r\n    <div class=\"overview-arch-stage anim-base anim-fade-left delay-100\">\r\n      <svg class=\"oas-rings-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 220\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#C4161C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"98\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 6\" opacity=\"0.55\" />\r\n        <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"70\" opacity=\"0.65\" />\r\n      </svg>\r\n      <div class=\"oas-navy-slab\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"oas-wireframe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"oas-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"oas-backdrop-img\">\r\n        <figure class=\"cr-figure\">\r\n          <img src=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/wp-content/themes/artha-child-theme/assets/images/artha-hospitality-food-service-quality-img.jpg\" alt=\"Exceptional dining atmosphere, food presentation, and guest experience\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n          <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">Exceptional dining atmosphere, food presentation, and guest experience</figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 2: OUR FOOD & SERVICE QUALITY FOCUS AREAS (DEEP ARCHITECTURAL NAVY #0D2244 - 5-ZONE BLUEPRINT MATRIX) -->\r\n<section class=\"quality-focus-sec\" id=\"focus-areas\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"head-center anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Pillars of Hospitality Excellence</span>\r\n      <h2>Our Food &amp; Service Quality Focus Areas.</h2>\r\n      <p>Elevating every customer touchpoint through consistent taste, thoughtful presentation, attentive service, and continuous quality monitoring.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quality-blueprint anim-base anim-fade-up delay-100\">\r\n      <!-- Top Row: 01 & 02 -->\r\n      <div class=\"qb-row-top\">\r\n        <!-- 01. Food Taste & Consistency -->\r\n        <article class=\"qb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"qb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"qb-num-pill\">01. Food Taste &amp; Consistency</span>\r\n            <span class=\"qb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-utensils\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"qb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Food Taste &amp; Consistency</h3>\r\n            <p>We emphasise consistent food preparation, taste, and quality to ensure that guests receive a dependable dining experience with every visit.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 02. Food Presentation -->\r\n        <article class=\"qb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"qb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"qb-num-pill\">02. Food Presentation</span>\r\n            <span class=\"qb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-concierge-bell\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"qb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Food Presentation</h3>\r\n            <p>We focus on the visual appeal of food through appropriate presentation, plating techniques, and attention to detail that enhance the overall dining experience.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Bottom Row: 03, 04 & 05 -->\r\n      <div class=\"qb-row-bottom\">\r\n        <!-- 03. Service Standards -->\r\n        <article class=\"qb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"qb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"qb-num-pill\">03. Service Standards</span>\r\n            <span class=\"qb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-user-tie\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"qb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Service Standards</h3>\r\n            <p>We encourage professional service practices, proper staff conduct, and attentive guest interaction to maintain consistency across customer touchpoints.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 04. Guest Experience & Satisfaction -->\r\n        <article class=\"qb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"qb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"qb-num-pill\">04. Guest Experience</span>\r\n            <span class=\"qb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-smile-beam\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"qb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Guest Experience &amp; Satisfaction</h3>\r\n            <p>We focus on understanding guest expectations, improving service interactions, and creating welcoming experiences that contribute to customer satisfaction.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 05. Quality Monitoring -->\r\n        <article class=\"qb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"qb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"qb-num-pill\">05. Quality Monitoring</span>\r\n            <span class=\"qb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-clipboard-check\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"qb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Quality Monitoring</h3>\r\n            <p>We emphasise regular attention to food and service standards to identify areas for improvement and maintain consistency across everyday operations.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 3: OUR APPROACH TO FOOD & SERVICE QUALITY (LIGHT SLATE-BLUE TINT #EDF2F8 - 4 CARDS) -->\r\n<section class=\"approach-sec\" id=\"quality-approach\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"head-center anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Our Process</span>\r\n      <h2>Our Approach to Food &amp; Service Quality.</h2>\r\n      <p>A structured four-step methodology to establish clear culinary and service standards, refine delivery, and sustain guest satisfaction.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"approach-grid\">\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-100\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-award\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Understanding Your Quality Standards</h3>\r\n        <p>We begin by understanding your food offerings, service style, business expectations, and the experience you want to deliver to your guests.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-200\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-double\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Establishing Consistent Practices</h3>\r\n        <p>We focus on maintaining consistency in food preparation, taste, presentation, and customer service through clearly defined standards.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-300\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-hands-helping\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Improving Service Delivery</h3>\r\n        <p>We encourage professional staff behaviour, effective communication, and attentive guest service to create smoother customer interactions.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-400\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-sync-alt\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Monitoring &amp; Continuous Improvement</h3>\r\n        <p>We emphasise ongoing attention to food and service quality, identifying opportunities to improve consistency and enhance the overall guest experience.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 4: CTA (WARM GOLD CHAMPAGNE #EFE3C6) -->\r\n<section class=\"cta\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap cta-inner anim-base anim-zoom-in\">\r\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\">Let\'s Create Experiences Worth Returning For.</span>\r\n    <h2>Quality That Builds Trust. Service That Creates Loyalty.</h2>\r\n    <p>Guests remember how a dining experience makes them feel. Consistent food quality, thoughtful presentation, and professional service can turn first-time visitors into loyal customers.</p>\r\n    <p>Let Artha Hospitality Management help you establish stronger food and service standards that enhance guest satisfaction and support the long-term success of your hospitality business.</p>\r\n    <div class=\"cta-btns\">\r\n      <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/contact-us\" class=\"btn btn-light\">Partner With Artha <span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a>\r\n      <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/contact-us#contact-form-section\" class=\"btn btn-outline-light\">Get in Touch</a>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n</article>', 'Food and Service Quality', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'food-and-service-quality', '', '', '2026-11-26 09:51:21', '2026-11-26 09:51:21', '', 0, 'http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/?page_id=40', 0, 'page', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES(41, 1, '2026-11-26 09:51:06', '2026-11-26 09:51:06', '<article>\r\n<!-- NEW 75VH CULINARY CLOCHE MEDALLION, 5-STAR CONSTELLATION & HOSPITALITY EXCELLENCE HERO SECTION -->\r\n<section class=\"quality-hero\" id=\"quality-top\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap quality-hero-grid\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- Left Column: Editorial Copy & CTAs -->\r\n    <div class=\"quality-hero-copy anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <div class=\"service-meta-row\">\r\n        <nav class=\"crumb-badge\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\r\n          <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management\">Home</a>\r\n          <span class=\"sep\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i></span>\r\n          <a href=\"#\">Services</a>\r\n          <span class=\"sep\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i></span>\r\n          <span class=\"curr\">Food &amp; Service Quality</span>\r\n        </nav>\r\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">Culinary &amp; Service Standards</span>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <h1>Excellence in Every Dish. <em>Exceptional Service in Every Experience.</em></h1>\r\n      <p>Quality is at the heart of every successful hospitality business. At Artha Hospitality Management, we focus on maintaining high standards of food quality, presentation, and customer service to create memorable guest experiences.</p>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"quality-hero-actions\">\r\n        <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/contact-us\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Partner With Artha <span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a>\r\n        <a href=\"#focus-areas\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Our Quality Focus Areas</a>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Right Column: Culinary Cloche Rim Stage, Award Crest & 5-Star Constellation (No Text) -->\r\n    <div class=\"quality-crest-stage anim-base anim-fade-left delay-100\">\r\n      <svg class=\"qc-rim-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 240 240\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#C4161C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"120\" r=\"108\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 6\" opacity=\"0.5\" />\r\n        <circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"120\" r=\"82\" opacity=\"0.65\" />\r\n        <circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"120\" r=\"56\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 5\" opacity=\"0.75\" />\r\n      </svg>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"qc-navy-platter\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"qc-wireframe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Main Sculpted Culinary Cloche Window -->\r\n      <div class=\"qc-main-frame\">\r\n        <figure class=\"cr-figure\">\r\n          <img src=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/wp-content/themes/artha-child-theme/assets/images/artha-hospitality-food-service-quality-hero.jpg\" alt=\"Refined culinary presentation and attentive hospitality service\" loading=\"eager\">\r\n          <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">Refined culinary presentation and attentive hospitality service</figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Gold Award Excellence Seal (Top-Right, Icon Only) -->\r\n      <div class=\"qc-award-seal\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <i class=\"fas fa-award\"></i>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- 5-Star Service Quality Constellation Dock (Bottom-Left, Icons Only, No Text) -->\r\n      <div class=\"qc-star-constellation\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <i class=\"fas fa-star\"></i>\r\n        <i class=\"fas fa-star\"></i>\r\n        <i class=\"fas fa-star\"></i>\r\n        <i class=\"fas fa-star\"></i>\r\n        <i class=\"fas fa-star\"></i>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 1: CREATING EXPERIENCES GUESTS WANT TO RETURN TO (OFFWHITE) -->\r\n<section class=\"quality-overview-sec\" id=\"quality-overview\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap overview-split\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"overview-copy anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Trust &amp; Guest Loyalty</span>\r\n      <h2>Creating Experiences Guests <em>Want to Return To.</em></h2>\r\n      <p>A great hospitality experience goes beyond serving good food. It combines consistent taste, appealing presentation, attentive service, and an environment where guests feel valued.</p>\r\n      <p>Whether you operate a restaurant, café, hotel, or resto-bar, we help you focus on the essential elements of food and service quality that influence customer perceptions, build trust, and encourage repeat visits.</p>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"quality-callout\">\r\n        <span>Standards That Build Satisfaction</span>\r\n        <p>“From consistency in taste and food presentation to professional service practices and guest interaction, we help hospitality businesses establish standards that strengthen customer satisfaction and encourage lasting loyalty.”</p>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Right Column: Single Image with Shapes (No Text) -->\r\n    <div class=\"overview-arch-stage anim-base anim-fade-left delay-100\">\r\n      <svg class=\"oas-rings-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 220\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#C4161C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"98\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 6\" opacity=\"0.55\" />\r\n        <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"70\" opacity=\"0.65\" />\r\n      </svg>\r\n      <div class=\"oas-navy-slab\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"oas-wireframe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"oas-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"oas-backdrop-img\">\r\n        <figure class=\"cr-figure\">\r\n          <img src=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/wp-content/themes/artha-child-theme/assets/images/artha-hospitality-food-service-quality-img.jpg\" alt=\"Exceptional dining atmosphere, food presentation, and guest experience\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n          <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">Exceptional dining atmosphere, food presentation, and guest experience</figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 2: OUR FOOD & SERVICE QUALITY FOCUS AREAS (DEEP ARCHITECTURAL NAVY #0D2244 - 5-ZONE BLUEPRINT MATRIX) -->\r\n<section class=\"quality-focus-sec\" id=\"focus-areas\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"head-center anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Pillars of Hospitality Excellence</span>\r\n      <h2>Our Food &amp; Service Quality Focus Areas.</h2>\r\n      <p>Elevating every customer touchpoint through consistent taste, thoughtful presentation, attentive service, and continuous quality monitoring.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"quality-blueprint anim-base anim-fade-up delay-100\">\r\n      <!-- Top Row: 01 & 02 -->\r\n      <div class=\"qb-row-top\">\r\n        <!-- 01. Food Taste & Consistency -->\r\n        <article class=\"qb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"qb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"qb-num-pill\">01. Food Taste &amp; Consistency</span>\r\n            <span class=\"qb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-utensils\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"qb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Food Taste &amp; Consistency</h3>\r\n            <p>We emphasise consistent food preparation, taste, and quality to ensure that guests receive a dependable dining experience with every visit.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 02. Food Presentation -->\r\n        <article class=\"qb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"qb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"qb-num-pill\">02. Food Presentation</span>\r\n            <span class=\"qb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-concierge-bell\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"qb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Food Presentation</h3>\r\n            <p>We focus on the visual appeal of food through appropriate presentation, plating techniques, and attention to detail that enhance the overall dining experience.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Bottom Row: 03, 04 & 05 -->\r\n      <div class=\"qb-row-bottom\">\r\n        <!-- 03. Service Standards -->\r\n        <article class=\"qb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"qb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"qb-num-pill\">03. Service Standards</span>\r\n            <span class=\"qb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-user-tie\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"qb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Service Standards</h3>\r\n            <p>We encourage professional service practices, proper staff conduct, and attentive guest interaction to maintain consistency across customer touchpoints.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 04. Guest Experience & Satisfaction -->\r\n        <article class=\"qb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"qb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"qb-num-pill\">04. Guest Experience</span>\r\n            <span class=\"qb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-smile-beam\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"qb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Guest Experience &amp; Satisfaction</h3>\r\n            <p>We focus on understanding guest expectations, improving service interactions, and creating welcoming experiences that contribute to customer satisfaction.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 05. Quality Monitoring -->\r\n        <article class=\"qb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"qb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"qb-num-pill\">05. Quality Monitoring</span>\r\n            <span class=\"qb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-clipboard-check\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"qb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Quality Monitoring</h3>\r\n            <p>We emphasise regular attention to food and service standards to identify areas for improvement and maintain consistency across everyday operations.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 3: OUR APPROACH TO FOOD & SERVICE QUALITY (LIGHT SLATE-BLUE TINT #EDF2F8 - 4 CARDS) -->\r\n<section class=\"approach-sec\" id=\"quality-approach\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"head-center anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Our Process</span>\r\n      <h2>Our Approach to Food &amp; Service Quality.</h2>\r\n      <p>A structured four-step methodology to establish clear culinary and service standards, refine delivery, and sustain guest satisfaction.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"approach-grid\">\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-100\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-award\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Understanding Your Quality Standards</h3>\r\n        <p>We begin by understanding your food offerings, service style, business expectations, and the experience you want to deliver to your guests.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-200\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-double\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Establishing Consistent Practices</h3>\r\n        <p>We focus on maintaining consistency in food preparation, taste, presentation, and customer service through clearly defined standards.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-300\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-hands-helping\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Improving Service Delivery</h3>\r\n        <p>We encourage professional staff behaviour, effective communication, and attentive guest service to create smoother customer interactions.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-400\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-sync-alt\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Monitoring &amp; Continuous Improvement</h3>\r\n        <p>We emphasise ongoing attention to food and service quality, identifying opportunities to improve consistency and enhance the overall guest experience.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 4: CTA (WARM GOLD CHAMPAGNE #EFE3C6) -->\r\n<section class=\"cta\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap cta-inner anim-base anim-zoom-in\">\r\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\">Let\'s Create Experiences Worth Returning For.</span>\r\n    <h2>Quality That Builds Trust. Service That Creates Loyalty.</h2>\r\n    <p>Guests remember how a dining experience makes them feel. Consistent food quality, thoughtful presentation, and professional service can turn first-time visitors into loyal customers.</p>\r\n    <p>Let Artha Hospitality Management help you establish stronger food and service standards that enhance guest satisfaction and support the long-term success of your hospitality business.</p>\r\n    <div class=\"cta-btns\">\r\n      <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/contact-us\" class=\"btn btn-light\">Partner With Artha <span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a>\r\n      <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/contact-us#contact-form-section\" class=\"btn btn-outline-light\">Get in Touch</a>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n</article>', 'Food and Service Quality', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '40-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-11-26 09:51:06', '2026-11-26 09:51:06', '', 40, 'http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/?p=41', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES(42, 1, '2026-11-26 09:55:29', '2026-11-26 09:55:29', '<article>\r\n<!-- UNIQUE 75VH HERO -->\r\n<section class=\"ind-hero\" id=\"industries-top\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap ind-hero-grid\">\r\n    <div class=\"ind-hero-copy\">\r\n      <div class=\"hero-top-tags\">\r\n        <div class=\"crumb-badge\">\r\n          <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/\">Home</a>\r\n          <span class=\"sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i></span>\r\n          <span class=\"curr\">Industries We Serve</span>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">Hospitality Sectors</span>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <h1>Operational Excellence Across <em>Every Hospitality Format.</em></h1>\r\n      <p>From boutique hotels and fine-dining restaurants to high-energy resto-bars, neighbourhood cafés, and delivery-first cloud kitchens, Artha builds systems tailored to how each format actually operates.</p>\r\n      <div class=\"ind-hero-ctas\">\r\n        <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/contact-us#contact-form-section\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Book a Free Consultation <span class=\"arrow\">&rarr;</span></a>\r\n        <a href=\"#sectors\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Explore Sectors</a>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"ind-hero-stage\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n      <div class=\"ind-stage-backdrop\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"ind-stage-dots\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"ind-shape-ring\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"ind-shape-obsidian\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"ind-shape-pill\"></div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"ind-stage-photo\">\r\n        <img src=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/wp-content/themes/artha-child-theme/assets/images/artha-hospitality-mangement-hotels-img.jpg\" alt=\"Luxury hotel room and hospitality operations\">\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 1: CORE HOSPITALITY SECTORS -->\r\n<section id=\"sectors\" class=\"sectors-sec\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"head-center anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Core Sectors</span>\r\n      <h2>Specialized Solutions for Diverse Hospitality Venues.</h2>\r\n      <p>Every concept has distinct guest expectations, kitchen workflows, and staffing structures. We align capital, space, and daily execution to your format.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"sectors-grid\">\r\n      <article class=\"sector-card\">\r\n        <div class=\"sector-media\">\r\n          <img src=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/wp-content/themes/artha-child-theme/assets/images/artha-hospitality-mangement-restruant-img.jpg\" alt=\"Fine dining and casual restaurant interior\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n          <span class=\"sector-pill\">Dining</span>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"sector-body\">\r\n          <h3>Restaurants &amp; Specialty Dining</h3>\r\n          <p>End-to-end support for fine dining, casual family restaurants, and regional specialty outlets—balancing ambiance, kitchen speed, and table turnover.</p>\r\n          <ul class=\"sector-points\">\r\n            <li><i class=\"fas fa-check\"></i> Kitchen &amp; dining flow planning</li>\r\n            <li><i class=\"fas fa-check\"></i> Chef, steward &amp; captain staffing</li>\r\n            <li><i class=\"fas fa-check\"></i> Food cost &amp; portion control SOPs</li>\r\n          </ul>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"sector-card\">\r\n        <div class=\"sector-media\">\r\n          <img src=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/wp-content/themes/artha-child-theme/assets/images/artha-hospitality-mangement-hotels-img.jpg\" alt=\"Business hotel and boutique stay\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n          <span class=\"sector-pill\">Stays</span>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"sector-body\">\r\n          <h3>Hotels &amp; Boutique Properties</h3>\r\n          <p>Structured pre-opening, multi-outlet F&amp;B coordination, and trained front-office and housekeeping teams that elevate guest satisfaction.</p>\r\n          <ul class=\"sector-points\">\r\n            <li><i class=\"fas fa-check\"></i> Front office &amp; housekeeping systems</li>\r\n            <li><i class=\"fas fa-check\"></i> Room service &amp; all-day dining setup</li>\r\n            <li><i class=\"fas fa-check\"></i> Service quality audits &amp; training</li>\r\n          </ul>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"sector-card\">\r\n        <div class=\"sector-media\">\r\n          <img src=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/wp-content/themes/artha-child-theme/assets/images/artha-hospitality-mangement-pub-and-resto-img.jpg\" alt=\"Pub and resto-bar interior\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n          <span class=\"sector-pill\">Nightlife</span>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"sector-body\">\r\n          <h3>Pubs, Resto-Bars &amp; Lounges</h3>\r\n          <p>High-throughput bar stations, atmosphere-driven interiors, beverage inventory controls, and agile floor service built for peak weekend volume.</p>\r\n          <ul class=\"sector-points\">\r\n            <li><i class=\"fas fa-check\"></i> Bar ergonomics &amp; dispense flow</li>\r\n            <li><i class=\"fas fa-check\"></i> Bartender &amp; floor team hiring</li>\r\n            <li><i class=\"fas fa-check\"></i> Beverage cost &amp; shrinkage control</li>\r\n          </ul>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"sector-card\">\r\n        <div class=\"sector-media\">\r\n          <img src=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/wp-content/themes/artha-child-theme/assets/images/artha-hospitality-location-selection-overview.jpg\" alt=\"Modern café and bakery seating\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n          <span class=\"sector-pill\">Cafés</span>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"sector-body\">\r\n          <h3>Cafés, Bakeries &amp; Patisseries</h3>\r\n          <p>Neighbourhood site selection, compact espresso-bar layouts, and consistent barista and counter service for steady all-day footfall.</p>\r\n          <ul class=\"sector-points\">\r\n            <li><i class=\"fas fa-check\"></i> High-visibility location scouting</li>\r\n            <li><i class=\"fas fa-check\"></i> Compact counter &amp; display design</li>\r\n            <li><i class=\"fas fa-check\"></i> Barista &amp; bakery staff sourcing</li>\r\n          </ul>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"sector-card\">\r\n        <div class=\"sector-media\">\r\n          <img src=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/wp-content/themes/artha-child-theme/assets/images/artha-hospitality-kitchen-design-hero.jpg\" alt=\"Commercial cloud kitchen workflow\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n          <span class=\"sector-pill\">Delivery</span>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"sector-body\">\r\n          <h3>Cloud Kitchens &amp; QSR Hubs</h3>\r\n          <p>Efficiency-first commercial kitchens engineered for rapid ticket times, low overhead, multi-brand output, and strict packaging and hygiene standards.</p>\r\n          <ul class=\"sector-points\">\r\n            <li><i class=\"fas fa-check\"></i> Zero-bottleneck prep &amp; dispatch zones</li>\r\n            <li><i class=\"fas fa-check\"></i> Vendor &amp; bulk purchase negotiation</li>\r\n            <li><i class=\"fas fa-check\"></i> Unit-level running cost optimization</li>\r\n          </ul>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"sector-card\">\r\n        <div class=\"sector-media\">\r\n          <img src=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/wp-content/themes/artha-child-theme/assets/images/slide-img-2-lgr.jpg\" alt=\"Luxury resort and banquet venue\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n          <span class=\"sector-pill\">Events</span>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"sector-body\">\r\n          <h3>Resorts &amp; Banquet Venues</h3>\r\n          <p>High-capacity banquet kitchens, outdoor-indoor service logistics, and scalable hospitality teams for destination stays and large celebrations.</p>\r\n          <ul class=\"sector-points\">\r\n            <li><i class=\"fas fa-check\"></i> Bulk kitchen &amp; cold-chain planning</li>\r\n            <li><i class=\"fas fa-check\"></i> Event F&amp;B &amp; banquet staffing</li>\r\n            <li><i class=\"fas fa-check\"></i> Five-star guest experience standards</li>\r\n          </ul>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </article>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 2: HOW WE TAILOR BY FORMAT -->\r\n<section id=\"matrix\" class=\"tailor-sec\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"head-split anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <div>\r\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">Format-Specific Execution</span>\r\n        <h2>One Methodology, Customized to Your Business Model.</h2>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <p>Whether you are launching a 30-seat neighbourhood café or a full-service hotel, we adapt four core pillars to protect your investment and service standards.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"tailor-grid\">\r\n      <article class=\"tailor-card\">\r\n        <span class=\"tailor-num\">01</span>\r\n        <h3>Capital &amp; Feasibility</h3>\r\n        <p>Format-accurate CapEx budgets, equipment schedules, and break-even projections before civil work begins.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n      <article class=\"tailor-card\">\r\n        <span class=\"tailor-num\">02</span>\r\n        <h3>Spatial &amp; Kitchen Flow</h3>\r\n        <p>Custom front-of-house seating ratios and back-of-house kitchen layouts tailored to your menu and cover volume.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n      <article class=\"tailor-card\">\r\n        <span class=\"tailor-num\">03</span>\r\n        <h3>Staffing &amp; Training</h3>\r\n        <p>Verified recruitment across chefs, front office, housekeeping, baristas, and F&amp;B service aligned to your outlet tier.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n      <article class=\"tailor-card\">\r\n        <span class=\"tailor-num\">04</span>\r\n        <h3>Cost &amp; Quality SOPs</h3>\r\n        <p>Daily food cost tracking, vendor audits, and guest service checklists that keep quality consistent after launch.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 3: STRATEGIC IMPACT -->\r\n<section id=\"value\" class=\"impact-sec\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"head-center anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">The Artha Advantage</span>\r\n      <h2>Built for Owners Seeking Long-Term Operational Clarity.</h2>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"impact-grid\">\r\n      <article class=\"impact-card\">\r\n        <span class=\"impact-ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-compass-drafting\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Format-Specific Blueprints</h3>\r\n        <p>No cookie-cutter templates—every layout, staffing roster, and vendor list is built around your exact cuisine, seating, and city market.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n      <article class=\"impact-card\">\r\n        <span class=\"impact-ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-layer-group\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>End-to-End Execution</h3>\r\n        <p>Single-point coordination from location scouting and civil interiors to pre-opening launch and ongoing staff recruitment.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n      <article class=\"impact-card\">\r\n        <span class=\"impact-ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-chart-line\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Sustainable Unit Economics</h3>\r\n        <p>Practical cost controls and verified vendor partnerships that protect margins without compromising the guest experience.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- CTA -->\r\n<section class=\"cta\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"cta-split-grid\">\r\n      <article class=\"cta-box\">\r\n        <span class=\"cta-box-ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-hotel\"></i></span>\r\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">FOR HOTEL OWNERS</span>\r\n        <h2>Need Staff for Your Hotel?</h2>\r\n        <p>Hire trained, verified staff with Artha.</p>\r\n        <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/contact-us#contact-form-section\" class=\"btn\">Hire Staff Now <span class=\"arrow\">&rarr;</span></a>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"cta-box\">\r\n        <span class=\"cta-box-ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-briefcase\"></i></span>\r\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">FOR JOB SEEKERS</span>\r\n        <h2>Looking for a Hotel Job?</h2>\r\n        <p>Apply for Chef, Front Office, Housekeeping &amp; F&amp;B jobs.</p>\r\n        <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/#job-opportunities\" class=\"btn\">Apply for Jobs <span class=\"arrow\">&rarr;</span></a>\r\n      </article>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n</article>', 'Industries', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '14-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-11-26 09:55:29', '2026-11-26 09:55:29', '', 14, 'http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/?p=42', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES(43, 1, '2026-11-26 10:03:22', '2026-11-26 10:03:22', '<article>\r\n<!-- NEW 75VH INTERIOR MOODBOARD, FLUTED PANEL & SWATCH HERO SECTION -->\r\n<section class=\"interior-hero\" id=\"interior-top\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap interior-hero-grid\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- Left Column: Editorial Copy & CTAs -->\r\n    <div class=\"interior-hero-copy anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <div class=\"service-meta-row\">\r\n        <nav class=\"crumb-badge\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\r\n          <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/\">Home</a>\r\n          <span class=\"sep\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i></span>\r\n          <a href=\"#\">Services</a>\r\n          <span class=\"sep\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i></span>\r\n          <span class=\"curr\">Interior Work</span>\r\n        </nav>\r\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">Interior Design &amp; Furnishing</span>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <h1>Creating Beautiful Spaces. <em>Enhancing Guest Experiences.</em></h1>\r\n      <p>The atmosphere of a hospitality establishment plays an important role in shaping the guest experience. At Artha Hospitality Management, we focus on designing and furnishing indoor spaces that bring together aesthetics, comfort, functionality, and your brand identity.</p>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"interior-hero-actions\">\r\n        <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/contact-us\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Partner With Artha <span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a>\r\n        <a href=\"#focus-areas\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Our Interior Focus Areas</a>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Right Column: Fluted Wall Panel, Material Swatches & Sculpted Interior Window (No Text) -->\r\n    <div class=\"interior-mood-stage anim-base anim-fade-left delay-100\">\r\n      <svg class=\"im-halo-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 220\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#C4161C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"98\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 6\" opacity=\"0.55\" />\r\n        <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"70\" opacity=\"0.65\" />\r\n      </svg>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"im-fluted-panel\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"im-moulding-frame\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"im-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"im-main-window\">\r\n        <figure class=\"cr-figure\">\r\n          <img src=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/wp-content/themes/artha-child-theme/assets/images/artha-hospitality-interiour-work-hero.jpg\" alt=\"Warm and inviting hospitality interior design with ambient lighting\" loading=\"eager\">\r\n          <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">Warm and inviting hospitality interior design with ambient lighting</figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- 3-Swatch Material & Palette Cluster (Icons Only, No Text) -->\r\n      <div class=\"im-swatch-cluster\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <span class=\"im-swatch sw-navy\"><i class=\"fas fa-couch\"></i></span>\r\n        <span class=\"im-swatch sw-gold\"><i class=\"fas fa-lightbulb\"></i></span>\r\n        <span class=\"im-swatch sw-cream\"><i class=\"fas fa-palette\"></i></span>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 1: WHERE DESIGN MEETS COMFORT AND FUNCTIONALITY (OFFWHITE) -->\r\n<section class=\"interior-overview-sec\" id=\"interior-overview\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap overview-split\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"overview-copy anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Aesthetics &amp; Ambience</span>\r\n      <h2>Where Design Meets <em>Comfort and Functionality.</em></h2>\r\n      <p>A well-designed interior does more than make a space look attractive. It creates an inviting atmosphere, supports smooth operations, and encourages guests to feel comfortable throughout their visit.</p>\r\n      <p>Whether you are establishing a restaurant, café, hotel, or resto-bar, we help develop interior spaces that reflect your business concept while balancing visual appeal with practical everyday requirements.</p>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"ambience-callout\">\r\n        <span>Lasting Guest Impressions</span>\r\n        <p>“From thoughtful interior concepts and furniture selection to lighting, colour schemes, and finishing details, we help transform ordinary spaces into welcoming environments that leave a lasting impression on your guests.”</p>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Right Column: Single Image with Shapes (No Text) -->\r\n    <div class=\"overview-arch-stage anim-base anim-fade-left delay-100\">\r\n      <svg class=\"oas-rings-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 220\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#C4161C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"98\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 6\" opacity=\"0.55\" />\r\n        <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"70\" opacity=\"0.65\" />\r\n      </svg>\r\n      <div class=\"oas-navy-slab\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"oas-wireframe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"oas-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"oas-backdrop-img\">\r\n        <figure class=\"cr-figure\">\r\n          <img src=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/wp-content/themes/artha-child-theme/assets/images/artha-hospitality-interiour-work-img1.jpg\" alt=\"Bespoke restaurant table setting, lighting, and interior furnishing\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n          <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">Bespoke restaurant table setting, lighting, and interior furnishing</figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 2: OUR INTERIOR WORK FOCUS AREAS (DEEP ARCHITECTURAL NAVY #0D2244 - 5-ZONE BLUEPRINT MATRIX) -->\r\n<section class=\"interior-focus-sec\" id=\"focus-areas\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"head-center anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Curated Interior Elements</span>\r\n      <h2>Our Interior Work Focus Areas.</h2>\r\n      <p>Bringing together cohesive themes, ergonomic layouts, durable furnishings, and atmospheric lighting and décor.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"interior-blueprint anim-base anim-fade-up delay-100\">\r\n      <!-- Top Row: 01 & 02 -->\r\n      <div class=\"ib-row-top\">\r\n        <!-- 01. Interior Concept & Theme -->\r\n        <article class=\"ib-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"ib-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"ib-num-pill\">01. Interior Concept &amp; Theme</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ib-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-compass\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"ib-body\">\r\n            <h3>Interior Concept &amp; Theme</h3>\r\n            <p>We help establish interior concepts that reflect your brand identity, hospitality vision, and target audience, creating a consistent visual direction for your space.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 02. Space Planning & Layout -->\r\n        <article class=\"ib-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"ib-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"ib-num-pill\">02. Space Planning &amp; Layout</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ib-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-vector-square\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"ib-body\">\r\n            <h3>Space Planning &amp; Layout</h3>\r\n            <p>We focus on arranging interior spaces effectively, ensuring comfortable movement, practical furniture placement, and a balanced environment for guests and staff.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Bottom Row: 03, 04 & 05 -->\r\n      <div class=\"ib-row-bottom\">\r\n        <!-- 03. Furniture & Furnishing -->\r\n        <article class=\"ib-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"ib-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"ib-num-pill\">03. Furniture &amp; Furnishing</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ib-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-couch\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"ib-body\">\r\n            <h3>Furniture &amp; Furnishing</h3>\r\n            <p>We consider suitable furniture, fixtures, and furnishings that complement the overall design while providing comfort, durability, and functionality.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 04. Lighting & Colour Selection -->\r\n        <article class=\"ib-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"ib-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"ib-num-pill\">04. Lighting &amp; Colour</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ib-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-lightbulb\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"ib-body\">\r\n            <h3>Lighting &amp; Colour Selection</h3>\r\n            <p>We consider appropriate lighting arrangements and colour combinations to create the desired atmosphere, enhance visual appeal, and improve the overall guest experience.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 05. Finishing & Décor -->\r\n        <article class=\"ib-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"ib-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"ib-num-pill\">05. Finishing &amp; Décor</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ib-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-gem\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"ib-body\">\r\n            <h3>Finishing &amp; Décor</h3>\r\n            <p>We focus on interior finishes, decorative elements, textures, and details that bring the design together and give the hospitality space its distinctive character.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 3: OUR APPROACH TO INTERIOR WORK (LIGHT SLATE-BLUE TINT #EDF2F8 - 4 CARDS) -->\r\n<section class=\"approach-sec\" id=\"interior-approach\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"head-center anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Our Process</span>\r\n      <h2>Our Approach to Interior Work.</h2>\r\n      <p>A thoughtful four-step journey from initial brand discovery and concept development to furnishing and final finishing touches.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"approach-grid\">\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-100\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-eye\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Understanding Your Vision</h3>\r\n        <p>We begin by understanding your hospitality concept, brand identity, target audience, design preferences, and functional requirements.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-200\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-palette\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Developing the Design Concept</h3>\r\n        <p>We establish a suitable interior direction, considering themes, colours, materials, furniture styles, and the overall atmosphere you want to create.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-300\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-chair\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Planning &amp; Furnishing</h3>\r\n        <p>We focus on practical space arrangements, furniture selection, lighting, and other essential interior elements to bring the concept together.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-400\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-star\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Creating the Final Experience</h3>\r\n        <p>We pay attention to the finishing details to help create a comfortable, visually appealing, and functional environment that supports your hospitality business.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 4: CTA (WARM GOLD CHAMPAGNE #EFE3C6) -->\r\n<section class=\"cta\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap cta-inner anim-base anim-zoom-in\">\r\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\">Let\'s Create a Space That Reflects Your Hospitality Vision.</span>\r\n    <h2>Create an Atmosphere Your Guests Remember.</h2>\r\n    <p>The right interior can turn a simple visit into a memorable experience. Thoughtful design, comfortable furnishings, and a welcoming atmosphere help create spaces where guests enjoy spending time.</p>\r\n    <p>Let Artha Hospitality Management help you transform your vision into beautifully designed hospitality interiors that combine comfort, functionality, and lasting appeal.</p>\r\n    <div class=\"cta-btns\">\r\n      <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/contact-us\" class=\"btn btn-light\">Partner With Artha <span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a>\r\n      <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/contact-us#contact-form-section\" class=\"btn btn-outline-light\">Get in Touch</a>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n</article>', 'Interiour Work', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'interiour-work', '', '', '2026-11-26 10:03:22', '2026-11-26 10:03:22', '', 0, 'http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/?page_id=43', 0, 'page', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES(44, 1, '2026-11-26 10:03:22', '2026-11-26 10:03:22', '<article>\r\n<!-- NEW 75VH INTERIOR MOODBOARD, FLUTED PANEL & SWATCH HERO SECTION -->\r\n<section class=\"interior-hero\" id=\"interior-top\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap interior-hero-grid\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- Left Column: Editorial Copy & CTAs -->\r\n    <div class=\"interior-hero-copy anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <div class=\"service-meta-row\">\r\n        <nav class=\"crumb-badge\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\r\n          <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/\">Home</a>\r\n          <span class=\"sep\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i></span>\r\n          <a href=\"#\">Services</a>\r\n          <span class=\"sep\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i></span>\r\n          <span class=\"curr\">Interior Work</span>\r\n        </nav>\r\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">Interior Design &amp; Furnishing</span>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <h1>Creating Beautiful Spaces. <em>Enhancing Guest Experiences.</em></h1>\r\n      <p>The atmosphere of a hospitality establishment plays an important role in shaping the guest experience. At Artha Hospitality Management, we focus on designing and furnishing indoor spaces that bring together aesthetics, comfort, functionality, and your brand identity.</p>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"interior-hero-actions\">\r\n        <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/contact-us\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Partner With Artha <span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a>\r\n        <a href=\"#focus-areas\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Our Interior Focus Areas</a>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Right Column: Fluted Wall Panel, Material Swatches & Sculpted Interior Window (No Text) -->\r\n    <div class=\"interior-mood-stage anim-base anim-fade-left delay-100\">\r\n      <svg class=\"im-halo-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 220\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#C4161C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"98\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 6\" opacity=\"0.55\" />\r\n        <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"70\" opacity=\"0.65\" />\r\n      </svg>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"im-fluted-panel\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"im-moulding-frame\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"im-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"im-main-window\">\r\n        <figure class=\"cr-figure\">\r\n          <img src=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/wp-content/themes/artha-child-theme/assets/images/artha-hospitality-interiour-work-hero.jpg\" alt=\"Warm and inviting hospitality interior design with ambient lighting\" loading=\"eager\">\r\n          <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">Warm and inviting hospitality interior design with ambient lighting</figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- 3-Swatch Material & Palette Cluster (Icons Only, No Text) -->\r\n      <div class=\"im-swatch-cluster\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <span class=\"im-swatch sw-navy\"><i class=\"fas fa-couch\"></i></span>\r\n        <span class=\"im-swatch sw-gold\"><i class=\"fas fa-lightbulb\"></i></span>\r\n        <span class=\"im-swatch sw-cream\"><i class=\"fas fa-palette\"></i></span>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 1: WHERE DESIGN MEETS COMFORT AND FUNCTIONALITY (OFFWHITE) -->\r\n<section class=\"interior-overview-sec\" id=\"interior-overview\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap overview-split\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"overview-copy anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Aesthetics &amp; Ambience</span>\r\n      <h2>Where Design Meets <em>Comfort and Functionality.</em></h2>\r\n      <p>A well-designed interior does more than make a space look attractive. It creates an inviting atmosphere, supports smooth operations, and encourages guests to feel comfortable throughout their visit.</p>\r\n      <p>Whether you are establishing a restaurant, café, hotel, or resto-bar, we help develop interior spaces that reflect your business concept while balancing visual appeal with practical everyday requirements.</p>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"ambience-callout\">\r\n        <span>Lasting Guest Impressions</span>\r\n        <p>“From thoughtful interior concepts and furniture selection to lighting, colour schemes, and finishing details, we help transform ordinary spaces into welcoming environments that leave a lasting impression on your guests.”</p>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Right Column: Single Image with Shapes (No Text) -->\r\n    <div class=\"overview-arch-stage anim-base anim-fade-left delay-100\">\r\n      <svg class=\"oas-rings-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 220\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#C4161C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"98\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 6\" opacity=\"0.55\" />\r\n        <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"70\" opacity=\"0.65\" />\r\n      </svg>\r\n      <div class=\"oas-navy-slab\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"oas-wireframe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"oas-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"oas-backdrop-img\">\r\n        <figure class=\"cr-figure\">\r\n          <img src=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/wp-content/themes/artha-child-theme/assets/images/artha-hospitality-interiour-work-img1.jpg\" alt=\"Bespoke restaurant table setting, lighting, and interior furnishing\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n          <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">Bespoke restaurant table setting, lighting, and interior furnishing</figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 2: OUR INTERIOR WORK FOCUS AREAS (DEEP ARCHITECTURAL NAVY #0D2244 - 5-ZONE BLUEPRINT MATRIX) -->\r\n<section class=\"interior-focus-sec\" id=\"focus-areas\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"head-center anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Curated Interior Elements</span>\r\n      <h2>Our Interior Work Focus Areas.</h2>\r\n      <p>Bringing together cohesive themes, ergonomic layouts, durable furnishings, and atmospheric lighting and décor.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"interior-blueprint anim-base anim-fade-up delay-100\">\r\n      <!-- Top Row: 01 & 02 -->\r\n      <div class=\"ib-row-top\">\r\n        <!-- 01. Interior Concept & Theme -->\r\n        <article class=\"ib-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"ib-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"ib-num-pill\">01. Interior Concept &amp; Theme</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ib-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-compass\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"ib-body\">\r\n            <h3>Interior Concept &amp; Theme</h3>\r\n            <p>We help establish interior concepts that reflect your brand identity, hospitality vision, and target audience, creating a consistent visual direction for your space.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 02. Space Planning & Layout -->\r\n        <article class=\"ib-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"ib-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"ib-num-pill\">02. Space Planning &amp; Layout</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ib-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-vector-square\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"ib-body\">\r\n            <h3>Space Planning &amp; Layout</h3>\r\n            <p>We focus on arranging interior spaces effectively, ensuring comfortable movement, practical furniture placement, and a balanced environment for guests and staff.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Bottom Row: 03, 04 & 05 -->\r\n      <div class=\"ib-row-bottom\">\r\n        <!-- 03. Furniture & Furnishing -->\r\n        <article class=\"ib-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"ib-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"ib-num-pill\">03. Furniture &amp; Furnishing</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ib-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-couch\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"ib-body\">\r\n            <h3>Furniture &amp; Furnishing</h3>\r\n            <p>We consider suitable furniture, fixtures, and furnishings that complement the overall design while providing comfort, durability, and functionality.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 04. Lighting & Colour Selection -->\r\n        <article class=\"ib-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"ib-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"ib-num-pill\">04. Lighting &amp; Colour</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ib-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-lightbulb\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"ib-body\">\r\n            <h3>Lighting &amp; Colour Selection</h3>\r\n            <p>We consider appropriate lighting arrangements and colour combinations to create the desired atmosphere, enhance visual appeal, and improve the overall guest experience.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 05. Finishing & Décor -->\r\n        <article class=\"ib-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"ib-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"ib-num-pill\">05. Finishing &amp; Décor</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ib-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-gem\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"ib-body\">\r\n            <h3>Finishing &amp; Décor</h3>\r\n            <p>We focus on interior finishes, decorative elements, textures, and details that bring the design together and give the hospitality space its distinctive character.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 3: OUR APPROACH TO INTERIOR WORK (LIGHT SLATE-BLUE TINT #EDF2F8 - 4 CARDS) -->\r\n<section class=\"approach-sec\" id=\"interior-approach\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"head-center anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Our Process</span>\r\n      <h2>Our Approach to Interior Work.</h2>\r\n      <p>A thoughtful four-step journey from initial brand discovery and concept development to furnishing and final finishing touches.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"approach-grid\">\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-100\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-eye\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Understanding Your Vision</h3>\r\n        <p>We begin by understanding your hospitality concept, brand identity, target audience, design preferences, and functional requirements.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-200\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-palette\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Developing the Design Concept</h3>\r\n        <p>We establish a suitable interior direction, considering themes, colours, materials, furniture styles, and the overall atmosphere you want to create.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-300\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-chair\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Planning &amp; Furnishing</h3>\r\n        <p>We focus on practical space arrangements, furniture selection, lighting, and other essential interior elements to bring the concept together.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-400\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-star\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Creating the Final Experience</h3>\r\n        <p>We pay attention to the finishing details to help create a comfortable, visually appealing, and functional environment that supports your hospitality business.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 4: CTA (WARM GOLD CHAMPAGNE #EFE3C6) -->\r\n<section class=\"cta\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap cta-inner anim-base anim-zoom-in\">\r\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\">Let\'s Create a Space That Reflects Your Hospitality Vision.</span>\r\n    <h2>Create an Atmosphere Your Guests Remember.</h2>\r\n    <p>The right interior can turn a simple visit into a memorable experience. Thoughtful design, comfortable furnishings, and a welcoming atmosphere help create spaces where guests enjoy spending time.</p>\r\n    <p>Let Artha Hospitality Management help you transform your vision into beautifully designed hospitality interiors that combine comfort, functionality, and lasting appeal.</p>\r\n    <div class=\"cta-btns\">\r\n      <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/contact-us\" class=\"btn btn-light\">Partner With Artha <span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a>\r\n      <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/contact-us#contact-form-section\" class=\"btn btn-outline-light\">Get in Touch</a>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n</article>', 'Interiour Work', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '43-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-11-26 10:03:22', '2026-11-26 10:03:22', '', 43, 'http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/?p=44', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES(45, 1, '2026-11-26 10:06:50', '2026-11-26 10:06:50', '<article>\r\n<!-- NEW 75VH LOCATION SELECTION HERO SECTION -->\r\n<section class=\"loc-hero\" id=\"location-top\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap loc-hero-grid\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- Left Column: Editorial Copy & CTAs -->\r\n    <div class=\"loc-hero-copy anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <div class=\"service-meta-row\">\r\n        <nav class=\"crumb-badge\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\r\n          <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/\">Home</a>\r\n          <span class=\"sep\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i></span>\r\n          <a href=\"#\">Services</a>\r\n          <span class=\"sep\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i></span>\r\n          <span class=\"curr\">Location Selection</span>\r\n        </nav>\r\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">Location Selection</span>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <h1>The Right Location. <em>The Foundation of a Successful Business.</em></h1>\r\n      <p>Choosing the right location is one of the most important decisions when establishing a hospitality business. At Artha Hospitality Management, we help identify and evaluate potential locations based on customer demand, accessibility, competition, and long-term growth potential.</p>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"loc-hero-actions\">\r\n        <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/contact-us\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Partner With Artha <span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a>\r\n        <a href=\"#key-factors\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Key Factors We Evaluate</a>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Right Column: Sculpted Dome-Arch Image Stage with Radar/Compass Shapes (No Text) -->\r\n    <div class=\"loc-visual-stage anim-base anim-fade-left delay-100\">\r\n      <svg class=\"loc-shape-radar\" viewBox=\"0 0 240 240\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#C4161C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"120\" r=\"108\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 6\" opacity=\"0.55\" />\r\n        <circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"120\" r=\"78\" opacity=\"0.65\" />\r\n        <circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"120\" r=\"48\" opacity=\"0.4\" />\r\n        <line x1=\"120\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"240\" opacity=\"0.25\" />\r\n        <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"120\" opacity=\"0.25\" />\r\n      </svg>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"loc-shape-pedestal\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"loc-shape-wireframe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"loc-shape-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"loc-compass-pin\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <i class=\"fas fa-map-marker-alt\"></i>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"loc-dome-frame\">\r\n        <figure class=\"cr-figure\">\r\n          <img src=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/wp-content/themes/artha-child-theme/assets/images//artha-hospitality-location-selection-hero.jpg\" alt=\"Prime hospitality location and architectural destination\" loading=\"eager\">\r\n          <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">Prime hospitality location and architectural destination</figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 1: FINDING THE RIGHT PLACE FOR YOUR NEXT OPPORTUNITY (OFFWHITE) -->\r\n<section class=\"loc-opportunity-sec\" id=\"opportunity\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap opportunity-split\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"opportunity-copy anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Strategic Site Scouting</span>\r\n      <h2>Finding the Right Place for Your <em>Next Opportunity.</em></h2>\r\n      <p>A great hospitality concept deserves a location that supports its potential. Whether you are planning a restaurant, café, hotel, or resto-bar, selecting the right site plays a significant role in attracting customers and building a sustainable business.</p>\r\n      <p>We carefully assess different location opportunities, considering the surrounding market, customer movement, accessibility, and competitive landscape to help you identify a site that fits your business vision.</p>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"confidence-callout\">\r\n        <span>Informed Investment Decisions</span>\r\n        <p>“Our approach focuses on finding locations that align with your business concept, target audience, and operational objectives, helping you make informed investment decisions with greater confidence.”</p>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Right Column: Single Image with Shapes (No Text) -->\r\n    <div class=\"opportunity-arch-stage anim-base anim-fade-left delay-100\">\r\n      <svg class=\"opp-rings-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 220\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#C4161C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"98\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 6\" opacity=\"0.55\" />\r\n        <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"70\" opacity=\"0.65\" />\r\n      </svg>\r\n      <div class=\"opp-navy-slab\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"opp-wireframe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"opp-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"opp-backdrop-img\">\r\n        <figure class=\"cr-figure\">\r\n          <img src=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/wp-content/themes/artha-child-theme/assets/images//artha-hospitality-location-selection-overview.jpg\" alt=\"Vibrant restaurant and hospitality venue in a high-demand location\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n          <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">Vibrant restaurant and hospitality venue in a high-demand location</figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 2: KEY FACTORS WE EVALUATE (#F4EFE6 - 2x2 OPEN BLUEPRINT MATRIX) -->\r\n<section class=\"factors-sec\" id=\"key-factors\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"head-center anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Site Evaluation Criteria</span>\r\n      <h2>Key Factors We Evaluate.</h2>\r\n      <p>Every potential hospitality site is thoroughly analyzed across four core dimensions to ensure long-term viability and guest appeal.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"factors-matrix anim-base anim-fade-up delay-100\">\r\n      <!-- Factor 01 -->\r\n      <article class=\"fm-cell\">\r\n        <div class=\"fm-top\">\r\n          <span class=\"fm-num-pill\">01. Customer Demand</span>\r\n          <span class=\"fm-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-users\"></i></span>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"fm-body\">\r\n          <h3>Customer Demand</h3>\r\n          <p>We assess the presence of your target audience, local customer preferences, and demand for your hospitality concept within the surrounding area.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Factor 02 -->\r\n      <article class=\"fm-cell\">\r\n        <div class=\"fm-top\">\r\n          <span class=\"fm-num-pill\">02. Accessibility &amp; Visibility</span>\r\n          <span class=\"fm-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-road\"></i></span>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"fm-body\">\r\n          <h3>Accessibility &amp; Visibility</h3>\r\n          <p>We consider ease of access, connectivity, visibility, parking availability, and the convenience of reaching the location for potential customers.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Factor 03 -->\r\n      <article class=\"fm-cell\">\r\n        <div class=\"fm-top\">\r\n          <span class=\"fm-num-pill\">03. Competition Analysis</span>\r\n          <span class=\"fm-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-chart-bar\"></i></span>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"fm-body\">\r\n          <h3>Competition Analysis</h3>\r\n          <p>We evaluate nearby hospitality businesses, understand the competitive environment, and identify opportunities to differentiate your business in the market.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Factor 04 -->\r\n      <article class=\"fm-cell\">\r\n        <div class=\"fm-top\">\r\n          <span class=\"fm-num-pill\">04. Growth Potential</span>\r\n          <span class=\"fm-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-seedling\"></i></span>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"fm-body\">\r\n          <h3>Growth Potential</h3>\r\n          <p>We examine the area\'s development prospects, surrounding infrastructure, customer movement, and future opportunities that may support long-term business growth.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </article>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 3: OUR APPROACH TO LOCATION SELECTION (OFFWHITE - 4 CARDS) -->\r\n<section class=\"approach-sec\" id=\"our-approach\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"head-center anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Our Process</span>\r\n      <h2>Our Approach to Location Selection.</h2>\r\n      <p>A structured, step-by-step methodology designed to align your hospitality concept with the ideal physical site.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"approach-grid\">\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-100\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-lightbulb\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Understanding Your Business Concept</h3>\r\n        <p>We begin by understanding your hospitality concept, target customers, business objectives, and location requirements.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-200\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-search-location\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Identifying Potential Locations</h3>\r\n        <p>We explore suitable areas and potential sites that align with your business vision and market positioning.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-300\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-clipboard-check\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Evaluating Site Opportunities</h3>\r\n        <p>We assess shortlisted locations against key factors such as customer demand, accessibility, competition, and growth potential.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-400\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-handshake\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Supporting Informed Decisions</h3>\r\n        <p>We help you compare potential sites and make a well-informed location decision that supports your business objectives.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 4: CTA (CHAMPAGNE #F5EBDD) -->\r\n<section class=\"cta\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap cta-inner anim-base anim-zoom-in\">\r\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\">Let\'s Find the Right Location for Your Business.</span>\r\n    <h2>Build Your Hospitality Business on the Right Foundation.</h2>\r\n    <p>The right location can create opportunities for visibility, customer engagement, and sustainable growth. Let Artha Hospitality Management help you identify a location that brings your hospitality vision closer to reality.</p>\r\n    <div class=\"cta-btns\">\r\n      <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/contact-us\" class=\"btn btn-light\">Partner With Artha <span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a>\r\n      <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/contact-us#contact-form-section\" class=\"btn btn-outline-light\">Get in Touch</a>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n</article>', 'Location Selection', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'location-selection', '', '', '2026-11-26 10:06:50', '2026-11-26 10:06:50', '', 0, 'http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/?page_id=45', 0, 'page', '', 0);
