dustry, creating awareness and building customer loyalty are essential for sustainable growth. The way your business presents itself, communicates with customers, and promotes its offerings can make a significant difference.</p>\r\n      <p>Whether you are launching a new restaurant, introducing a café, expanding a hotel, or repositioning an existing hospitality business, we help shape marketing initiatives that communicate your value and connect with your target audience.</p>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"brand-callout\">\r\n        <span>Reaching the Right Audience</span>\r\n        <p>“From establishing a distinctive brand identity to developing promotional strategies, we focus on helping your business reach the right audience, strengthen its market presence, and encourage repeat customers.”</p>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Right Column: Single Image with Shapes (No Text) -->\r\n    <div class=\"overview-arch-stage anim-base anim-fade-left delay-100\">\r\n      <svg class=\"oas-rings-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 220\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#C4161C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"98\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 6\" opacity=\"0.55\" />\r\n        <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"70\" opacity=\"0.65\" />\r\n      </svg>\r\n      <div class=\"oas-navy-slab\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"oas-wireframe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"oas-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"oas-backdrop-img\">\r\n        <figure class=\"cr-figure\">\r\n          <img src=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/wp-content/themes/artha-child-theme/assets/images//artha-hospitality-marketing-services-img1.jpg\" alt=\"Distinguished hospitality brand showcase and welcoming guest experience\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n          <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">Distinguished hospitality brand showcase and welcoming guest experience</figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 2: OUR MARKETING FOCUS AREAS (DEEP ARCHITECTURAL NAVY #0D2244 - 5-ZONE BLUEPRINT MATRIX) -->\r\n<section class=\"marketing-focus-sec\" id=\"focus-areas\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"head-center anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Strategic Brand Growth</span>\r\n      <h2>Our Marketing Focus Areas.</h2>\r\n      <p>Comprehensive branding, strategic promotion, and customer retention initiatives tailored for hospitality ventures.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"marketing-blueprint anim-base anim-fade-up delay-100\">\r\n      <!-- Top Row: 01 & 02 -->\r\n      <div class=\"mb-row-top\">\r\n        <!-- 01. Brand Identity & Positioning -->\r\n        <article class=\"mb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"mb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"mb-num-pill\">01. Brand Identity &amp; Positioning</span>\r\n            <span class=\"mb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-fingerprint\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"mb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Brand Identity &amp; Positioning</h3>\r\n            <p>We help establish a distinctive brand presence that reflects your business concept, values, offerings, and target audience, making your hospitality venture more recognisable in the market.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 02. Marketing Strategy -->\r\n        <article class=\"mb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"mb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"mb-num-pill\">02. Marketing Strategy</span>\r\n            <span class=\"mb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-chess-knight\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"mb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Marketing Strategy</h3>\r\n            <p>We focus on developing marketing approaches that align with your business objectives, identify suitable audiences, and create a clear direction for promoting your offerings.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Bottom Row: 03, 04 & 05 -->\r\n      <div class=\"mb-row-bottom\">\r\n        <!-- 03. Advertising & Promotion -->\r\n        <article class=\"mb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"mb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"mb-num-pill\">03. Advertising &amp; Promotion</span>\r\n            <span class=\"mb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-bullhorn\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"mb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Advertising &amp; Promotion</h3>\r\n            <p>We help plan promotional activities and advertising initiatives to increase brand awareness, communicate your offerings, and attract potential customers.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 04. Marketing Campaigns -->\r\n        <article class=\"mb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"mb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"mb-num-pill\">04. Marketing Campaigns</span>\r\n            <span class=\"mb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-rocket\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"mb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Marketing Campaigns</h3>\r\n            <p>We focus on developing engaging marketing campaigns around your business offerings, special occasions, new launches, and promotional opportunities.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 05. Customer Engagement & Retention -->\r\n        <article class=\"mb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"mb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"mb-num-pill\">05. Engagement &amp; Retention</span>\r\n            <span class=\"mb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-heart\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"mb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Customer Engagement &amp; Retention</h3>\r\n            <p>We emphasise consistent brand communication and customer-focused promotional initiatives that encourage repeat visits, strengthen relationships, and support long-term customer loyalty.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 3: OUR APPROACH TO MARKETING (LIGHT SLATE-BLUE TINT #EDF2F8 - 4 CARDS) -->\r\n<section class=\"approach-sec\" id=\"marketing-approach\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"head-center anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Our Process</span>\r\n      <h2>Our Approach to Marketing.</h2>\r\n      <p>A structured four-step framework to position your hospitality brand, reach the right customers, and cultivate lasting loyalty.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"approach-grid\">\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-100\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-search\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Understanding Your Brand</h3>\r\n        <p>We begin by understanding your business concept, offerings, target audience, competitive environment, and marketing objectives.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-200\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-compass\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Developing a Marketing Direction</h3>\r\n        <p>We identify suitable branding and promotional approaches that communicate your business identity and connect with the right customers.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-300\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-bullhorn\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Planning Advertising &amp; Campaigns</h3>\r\n        <p>We focus on organising advertising initiatives and marketing campaigns that create awareness and generate interest in your hospitality offerings.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-400\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-handshake\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Strengthening Customer Relationships</h3>\r\n        <p>We encourage consistent engagement and customer-focused promotional activities that help build brand recognition and encourage repeat business.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 4: CTA (WARM GOLD CHAMPAGNE #EFE3C6) -->\r\n<section class=\"cta\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap cta-inner anim-base anim-zoom-in\">\r\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\">Let\'s Build a Brand That Stands Out.</span>\r\n    <h2>Make Your Brand the Choice Customers Remember.</h2>\r\n    <p>A strong hospitality brand creates recognition, builds trust, and gives customers a reason to return. With the right branding, advertising, and promotional strategies, your business can establish a stronger presence in a competitive market.</p>\r\n    <p>Let Artha Hospitality Management help you create meaningful marketing initiatives that attract customers and support your business growth.</p>\r\n    <div class=\"cta-btns\">\r\n      <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/artha-hospitality-contact-us/\" class=\"btn btn-light\">Partner With Artha <span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a>\r\n      <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/artha-hospitality-contact-us/#contact-form-section\" class=\"btn btn-outline-light\">Get in Touch</a>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n</article>', 'Marketing Services', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '47-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-11-26 10:10:59', '2026-11-26 10:10:59', '', 47, 'http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/?p=48', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES(56, 1, '2026-11-26 10:16:01', '2026-11-26 10:16:01', '<article>\r\n<!-- NEW 75VH INTERLOCKING DUAL-ZONE DRAFTING HERO SECTION -->\r\n<section class=\"design-hero\" id=\"design-top\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap design-hero-grid\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- Left Column: Editorial Copy & CTAs -->\r\n    <div class=\"design-hero-copy anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <div class=\"service-meta-row\">\r\n        <nav class=\"crumb-badge\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\r\n          <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management\">Home</a>\r\n          <span class=\"sep\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i></span>\r\n          <a href=\"#\">Services</a>\r\n          <span class=\"sep\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i></span>\r\n          <span class=\"curr\">Outlet &amp; Kitchen Design</span>\r\n        </nav>\r\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">Outlet &amp; Kitchen Design</span>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <h1>Designing Spaces That <em>Work Beautifully.</em></h1>\r\n      <p>A successful hospitality business begins with a thoughtfully designed space. At Artha Hospitality Management, we specialise in planning dining areas and commercial kitchens that bring together functionality, efficiency, aesthetics, and an exceptional customer experience.</p>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"design-hero-actions\">\r\n        <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/contact-us\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Partner With Artha <span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a>\r\n        <a href=\"#focus-areas\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Our Design Focus Areas</a>\r\n      </div> \r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Right Column: Interlocking Dual-Zone Stage (Dining + Kitchen, No Text) -->\r\n    <div class=\"design-dual-stage anim-base anim-fade-left delay-100\">\r\n      <svg class=\"ds-rings-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 220\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#C4161C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"98\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 6\" opacity=\"0.55\" />\r\n        <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"70\" opacity=\"0.65\" />\r\n      </svg>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"ds-navy-square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"ds-gold-blueprint\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"ds-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Top-Left Frame: Dining Area -->\r\n      <div class=\"ds-outlet-frame\">\r\n        <figure class=\"cr-figure\">\r\n          <img src=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/wp-content/themes/artha-child-theme/assets/images/artha-hospitality-outlet-design-hero.jpg\" alt=\"Thoughtfully designed restaurant dining layout\" loading=\"eager\">\r\n          <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">Thoughtfully designed restaurant dining layout</figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Center Drafting Compass Node -->\r\n      <div class=\"ds-compass-node\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <i class=\"fas fa-drafting-compass\"></i>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Bottom-Right Frame: Commercial Kitchen -->\r\n      <div class=\"ds-kitchen-frame\">\r\n        <figure class=\"cr-figure\">\r\n          <img src=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/wp-content/themes/artha-child-theme/assets/images/artha-hospitality-kitchen-design-hero.jpg\" alt=\"Efficiently planned commercial kitchen workflow\" loading=\"eager\">\r\n          <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">Efficiently planned commercial kitchen workflow</figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 1: WHERE THOUGHTFUL DESIGN MEETS OPERATIONAL EXCELLENCE (OFFWHITE) -->\r\n<section class=\"design-overview-sec\" id=\"design-overview\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap overview-split\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"overview-copy anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Spatial &amp; Culinary Harmony</span>\r\n      <h2>Where Thoughtful Design Meets <em>Operational Excellence.</em></h2>\r\n      <p>Every corner of a hospitality outlet plays a role in its success. A well-designed dining area creates a welcoming atmosphere, while an intelligently planned kitchen allows staff to work efficiently and deliver consistent service.</p>\r\n      <p>Whether you are developing a restaurant, café, hotel, or resto-bar, we help transform your vision into practical, carefully planned spaces that balance visual appeal with everyday operational requirements.</p>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"harmony-callout\">\r\n        <span>Seamless Spatial Flow</span>\r\n        <p>“From the arrangement of dining spaces to the positioning of kitchen equipment, we focus on creating well-organised environments that support smooth operations, maximise available space, and enhance the overall guest experience.”</p>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Right Column: Single Image with Shapes (No Text) -->\r\n    <div class=\"overview-arch-stage anim-base anim-fade-left delay-100\">\r\n      <svg class=\"oas-rings-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 220\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#C4161C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"98\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 6\" opacity=\"0.55\" />\r\n        <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"70\" opacity=\"0.65\" />\r\n      </svg>\r\n      <div class=\"oas-navy-slab\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"oas-wireframe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"oas-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"oas-backdrop-img\">\r\n        <figure class=\"cr-figure\">\r\n          <img src=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/wp-content/themes/artha-child-theme/assets/images/artha-hospitality-outlet-kitchen-overview.jpg\" alt=\"Well-planned hospitality outlet interior and service bar\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n          <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">Well-planned hospitality outlet interior and service bar</figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 2: OUR DESIGN FOCUS AREAS (DEEP ARCHITECTURAL NAVY #0D2244 - 5-ZONE BLUEPRINT MATRIX) -->\r\n<section class=\"focus-sec\" id=\"focus-areas\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"head-center anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Key Pillars of Spatial Planning</span>\r\n      <h2>Our Design Focus Areas.</h2>\r\n      <p>Connecting front-of-house guest comfort with back-of-house kitchen precision across five essential design dimensions.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"focus-blueprint anim-base anim-fade-up delay-100\">\r\n      <!-- Top Row: 01 & 02 -->\r\n      <div class=\"fb-row-top\">\r\n        <!-- 01. Dining Area Planning -->\r\n        <article class=\"fb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"fb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"fb-num-pill\">01. Dining Area Planning</span>\r\n            <span class=\"fb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-chair\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"fb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Dining Area Planning</h3>\r\n            <p>We plan dining layouts that create a comfortable and inviting atmosphere while making effective use of available space. Our focus is on seating arrangements, customer movement, ambience, and overall guest comfort.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 02. Commercial Kitchen Layout -->\r\n        <article class=\"fb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"fb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"fb-num-pill\">02. Commercial Kitchen Layout</span>\r\n            <span class=\"fb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-utensils\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"fb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Commercial Kitchen Layout</h3>\r\n            <p>We plan kitchen spaces with a focus on workflow, equipment positioning, preparation areas, and operational convenience to support smooth and efficient kitchen operations.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Bottom Row: 03, 04 & 05 -->\r\n      <div class=\"fb-row-bottom\">\r\n        <!-- 03. Space Utilisation -->\r\n        <article class=\"fb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"fb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"fb-num-pill\">03. Space Utilisation</span>\r\n            <span class=\"fb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-expand-arrows-alt\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"fb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Space Utilisation</h3>\r\n            <p>We make the most of available space through thoughtful planning and organised layouts, ensuring that dining and kitchen areas function effectively without unnecessary congestion.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 04. Workflow & Operational Efficiency -->\r\n        <article class=\"fb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"fb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"fb-num-pill\">04. Workflow &amp; Efficiency</span>\r\n            <span class=\"fb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-project-diagram\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"fb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Workflow &amp; Operational Efficiency</h3>\r\n            <p>We consider the movement of staff, food, and service activities to create practical layouts that minimise unnecessary movement, improve coordination, and support faster service.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 05. Customer Experience & Ambience -->\r\n        <article class=\"fb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"fb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"fb-num-pill\">05. Experience &amp; Ambience</span>\r\n            <span class=\"fb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-star\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"fb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Customer Experience &amp; Ambience</h3>\r\n            <p>We focus on creating dining environments that reflect your brand identity, provide customer comfort, and contribute to a memorable hospitality experience.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 3: OUR APPROACH TO DESIGN (LIGHT SLATE-BLUE TINT #EDF2F8 - 4 CARDS) -->\r\n<section class=\"approach-sec\" id=\"design-approach\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"head-center anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Our Design Process</span>\r\n      <h2>Our Approach to Design.</h2>\r\n      <p>A collaborative, step-by-step design process that translates your culinary and hospitality concept into a high-performing physical space.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"approach-grid\">\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-100\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-compass\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Understanding Your Concept</h3>\r\n        <p>We begin by understanding your business model, cuisine, service style, brand identity, and operational requirements.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-200\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-drafting-compass\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Planning the Layout</h3>\r\n        <p>We develop practical layout concepts for dining areas and kitchens based on available space and the needs of your hospitality business.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-300\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-sliders-h\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Optimising Space &amp; Workflow</h3>\r\n        <p>We focus on effective space utilisation, equipment positioning, staff movement, and the connection between kitchen and service areas.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-400\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-gem\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Creating Functional Experiences</h3>\r\n        <p>We bring together operational efficiency and customer comfort to create spaces that are practical for your team and welcoming for your guests.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 4: CTA (WARM GOLD CHAMPAGNE #EFE3C6) -->\r\n<section class=\"cta\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap cta-inner anim-base anim-zoom-in\">\r\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\">Let\'s Design Your Next Hospitality Venture.</span>\r\n    <h2>Design a Space That Delivers More.</h2>\r\n    <p>A thoughtfully designed outlet does more than look impressive. It creates a better working environment, supports efficient operations, and makes every guest experience more enjoyable.</p>\r\n    <p>Let Artha Hospitality Management help you create spaces where functionality, design, and hospitality come together.</p>\r\n    <div class=\"cta-btns\">\r\n      <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/contact-us\" class=\"btn btn-light\">Partner With Artha <span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a>\r\n      <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/contact-us#contact-form-section\" class=\"btn btn-outline-light\">Get in Touch</a>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n</article>', 'Outlet & Kitchen Design', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'outlet-kitchen-design', '', '', '2026-11-26 10:16:01', '2026-11-26 10:16:01', '', 0, 'http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/?page_id=56', 0, 'page', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES(57, 1, '2026-11-26 10:16:01', '2026-11-26 10:16:01', '<article>\r\n<!-- NEW 75VH INTERLOCKING DUAL-ZONE DRAFTING HERO SECTION -->\r\n<section class=\"design-hero\" id=\"design-top\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap design-hero-grid\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- Left Column: Editorial Copy & CTAs -->\r\n    <div class=\"design-hero-copy anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <div class=\"service-meta-row\">\r\n        <nav class=\"crumb-badge\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\r\n          <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management\">Home</a>\r\n          <span class=\"sep\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i></span>\r\n          <a href=\"#\">Services</a>\r\n          <span class=\"sep\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i></span>\r\n          <span class=\"curr\">Outlet &amp; Kitchen Design</span>\r\n        </nav>\r\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">Outlet &amp; Kitchen Design</span>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <h1>Designing Spaces That <em>Work Beautifully.</em></h1>\r\n      <p>A successful hospitality business begins with a thoughtfully designed space. At Artha Hospitality Management, we specialise in planning dining areas and commercial kitchens that bring together functionality, efficiency, aesthetics, and an exceptional customer experience.</p>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"design-hero-actions\">\r\n        <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/contact-us\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Partner With Artha <span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a>\r\n        <a href=\"#focus-areas\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Our Design Focus Areas</a>\r\n      </div> \r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Right Column: Interlocking Dual-Zone Stage (Dining + Kitchen, No Text) -->\r\n    <div class=\"design-dual-stage anim-base anim-fade-left delay-100\">\r\n      <svg class=\"ds-rings-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 220\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#C4161C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"98\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 6\" opacity=\"0.55\" />\r\n        <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"70\" opacity=\"0.65\" />\r\n      </svg>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"ds-navy-square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"ds-gold-blueprint\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"ds-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Top-Left Frame: Dining Area -->\r\n      <div class=\"ds-outlet-frame\">\r\n        <figure class=\"cr-figure\">\r\n          <img src=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/wp-content/themes/artha-child-theme/assets/images/artha-hospitality-outlet-design-hero.jpg\" alt=\"Thoughtfully designed restaurant dining layout\" loading=\"eager\">\r\n          <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">Thoughtfully designed restaurant dining layout</figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Center Drafting Compass Node -->\r\n      <div class=\"ds-compass-node\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <i class=\"fas fa-drafting-compass\"></i>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Bottom-Right Frame: Commercial Kitchen -->\r\n      <div class=\"ds-kitchen-frame\">\r\n        <figure class=\"cr-figure\">\r\n          <img src=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/wp-content/themes/artha-child-theme/assets/images/artha-hospitality-kitchen-design-hero.jpg\" alt=\"Efficiently planned commercial kitchen workflow\" loading=\"eager\">\r\n          <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">Efficiently planned commercial kitchen workflow</figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 1: WHERE THOUGHTFUL DESIGN MEETS OPERATIONAL EXCELLENCE (OFFWHITE) -->\r\n<section class=\"design-overview-sec\" id=\"design-overview\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap overview-split\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"overview-copy anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Spatial &amp; Culinary Harmony</span>\r\n      <h2>Where Thoughtful Design Meets <em>Operational Excellence.</em></h2>\r\n      <p>Every corner of a hospitality outlet plays a role in its success. A well-designed dining area creates a welcoming atmosphere, while an intelligently planned kitchen allows staff to work efficiently and deliver consistent service.</p>\r\n      <p>Whether you are developing a restaurant, café, hotel, or resto-bar, we help transform your vision into practical, carefully planned spaces that balance visual appeal with everyday operational requirements.</p>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"harmony-callout\">\r\n        <span>Seamless Spatial Flow</span>\r\n        <p>“From the arrangement of dining spaces to the positioning of kitchen equipment, we focus on creating well-organised environments that support smooth operations, maximise available space, and enhance the overall guest experience.”</p>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Right Column: Single Image with Shapes (No Text) -->\r\n    <div class=\"overview-arch-stage anim-base anim-fade-left delay-100\">\r\n      <svg class=\"oas-rings-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 220\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#C4161C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"98\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 6\" opacity=\"0.55\" />\r\n        <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"70\" opacity=\"0.65\" />\r\n      </svg>\r\n      <div class=\"oas-navy-slab\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"oas-wireframe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"oas-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"oas-backdrop-img\">\r\n        <figure class=\"cr-figure\">\r\n          <img src=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/wp-content/themes/artha-child-theme/assets/images/artha-hospitality-outlet-kitchen-overview.jpg\" alt=\"Well-planned hospitality outlet interior and service bar\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n          <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">Well-planned hospitality outlet interior and service bar</figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 2: OUR DESIGN FOCUS AREAS (DEEP ARCHITECTURAL NAVY #0D2244 - 5-ZONE BLUEPRINT MATRIX) -->\r\n<section class=\"focus-sec\" id=\"focus-areas\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"head-center anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Key Pillars of Spatial Planning</span>\r\n      <h2>Our Design Focus Areas.</h2>\r\n      <p>Connecting front-of-house guest comfort with back-of-house kitchen precision across five essential design dimensions.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"focus-blueprint anim-base anim-fade-up delay-100\">\r\n      <!-- Top Row: 01 & 02 -->\r\n      <div class=\"fb-row-top\">\r\n        <!-- 01. Dining Area Planning -->\r\n        <article class=\"fb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"fb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"fb-num-pill\">01. Dining Area Planning</span>\r\n            <span class=\"fb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-chair\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"fb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Dining Area Planning</h3>\r\n            <p>We plan dining layouts that create a comfortable and inviting atmosphere while making effective use of available space. Our focus is on seating arrangements, customer movement, ambience, and overall guest comfort.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 02. Commercial Kitchen Layout -->\r\n        <article class=\"fb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"fb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"fb-num-pill\">02. Commercial Kitchen Layout</span>\r\n            <span class=\"fb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-utensils\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"fb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Commercial Kitchen Layout</h3>\r\n            <p>We plan kitchen spaces with a focus on workflow, equipment positioning, preparation areas, and operational convenience to support smooth and efficient kitchen operations.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Bottom Row: 03, 04 & 05 -->\r\n      <div class=\"fb-row-bottom\">\r\n        <!-- 03. Space Utilisation -->\r\n        <article class=\"fb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"fb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"fb-num-pill\">03. Space Utilisation</span>\r\n            <span class=\"fb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-expand-arrows-alt\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"fb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Space Utilisation</h3>\r\n            <p>We make the most of available space through thoughtful planning and organised layouts, ensuring that dining and kitchen areas function effectively without unnecessary congestion.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 04. Workflow & Operational Efficiency -->\r\n        <article class=\"fb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"fb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"fb-num-pill\">04. Workflow &amp; Efficiency</span>\r\n            <span class=\"fb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-project-diagram\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"fb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Workflow &amp; Operational Efficiency</h3>\r\n            <p>We consider the movement of staff, food, and service activities to create practical layouts that minimise unnecessary movement, improve coordination, and support faster service.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 05. Customer Experience & Ambience -->\r\n        <article class=\"fb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"fb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"fb-num-pill\">05. Experience &amp; Ambience</span>\r\n            <span class=\"fb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-star\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"fb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Customer Experience &amp; Ambience</h3>\r\n            <p>We focus on creating dining environments that reflect your brand identity, provide customer comfort, and contribute to a memorable hospitality experience.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 3: OUR APPROACH TO DESIGN (LIGHT SLATE-BLUE TINT #EDF2F8 - 4 CARDS) -->\r\n<section class=\"approach-sec\" id=\"design-approach\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"head-center anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Our Design Process</span>\r\n      <h2>Our Approach to Design.</h2>\r\n      <p>A collaborative, step-by-step design process that translates your culinary and hospitality concept into a high-performing physical space.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"approach-grid\">\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-100\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-compass\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Understanding Your Concept</h3>\r\n        <p>We begin by understanding your business model, cuisine, service style, brand identity, and operational requirements.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-200\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-drafting-compass\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Planning the Layout</h3>\r\n        <p>We develop practical layout concepts for dining areas and kitchens based on available space and the needs of your hospitality business.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-300\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-sliders-h\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Optimising Space &amp; Workflow</h3>\r\n        <p>We focus on effective space utilisation, equipment positioning, staff movement, and the connection between kitchen and service areas.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-400\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-gem\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Creating Functional Experiences</h3>\r\n        <p>We bring together operational efficiency and customer comfort to create spaces that are practical for your team and welcoming for your guests.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 4: CTA (WARM GOLD CHAMPAGNE #EFE3C6) -->\r\n<section class=\"cta\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap cta-inner anim-base anim-zoom-in\">\r\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\">Let\'s Design Your Next Hospitality Venture.</span>\r\n    <h2>Design a Space That Delivers More.</h2>\r\n    <p>A thoughtfully designed outlet does more than look impressive. It creates a better working environment, supports efficient operations, and makes every guest experience more enjoyable.</p>\r\n    <p>Let Artha Hospitality Management help you create spaces where functionality, design, and hospitality come together.</p>\r\n    <div class=\"cta-btns\">\r\n      <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/contact-us\" class=\"btn btn-light\">Partner With Artha <span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a>\r\n      <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/contact-us#contact-form-section\" class=\"btn btn-outline-light\">Get in Touch</a>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n</article>', 'Outlet & Kitchen Design', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '56-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-11-26 10:16:01', '2026-11-26 10:16:01', '', 56, 'http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/?p=57', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES(58, 1, '2026-11-26 10:20:31', '2026-11-26 10:20:31', '<article>\r\n<!-- NEW 75VH STAFFING SUPPORT CONSTELLATION ARCH HERO SECTION -->\r\n<section class=\"staff-hero\" id=\"staffing-top\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap staff-hero-grid\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- Left Column: Editorial Copy & CTAs -->\r\n    <div class=\"staff-hero-copy anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <div class=\"service-meta-row\">\r\n        <nav class=\"crumb-badge\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\r\n          <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/\">Home</a>\r\n          <span class=\"sep\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i></span>\r\n          <a href=\"#\">Services</a>\r\n          <span class=\"sep\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i></span>\r\n          <span class=\"curr\">Staffing Support</span>\r\n        </nav>\r\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">Staffing Support</span>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <h1>Building Strong Teams. <em>Delivering Exceptional Hospitality.</em></h1>\r\n      <p>Behind every successful hospitality business is a skilled, motivated, and well-managed team. At Artha Hospitality Management, we support hospitality businesses in building the right workforce through effective recruitment, staff training, and employee management.</p>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"staff-hero-actions\">\r\n        <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/artha-hospitality-contact-us/\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Partner With Artha <span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a>\r\n        <a href=\"#staffing-services\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Our Staffing Services</a> \r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Right Column: Sculpted Pill-Oval Portrait Stage with Connected Team Constellation (No Text) -->\r\n    <div class=\"staff-visual-stage anim-base anim-fade-left delay-100\">\r\n      <div class=\"sv-navy-wing-tl\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"sv-navy-wing-br\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"sv-gold-halo\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"sv-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"sv-main-portrait\">\r\n        <figure class=\"cr-figure\">\r\n          <img src=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/wp-content/themes/artha-child-theme/assets/images/artha-hospitality-staffing-hero.jpg\" alt=\"Skilled and motivated hospitality team in professional attire\" loading=\"eager\">\r\n          <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">Skilled and motivated hospitality team in professional attire</figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- 3-Node Connected Team Constellation Rail (Icons Only, No Text) -->\r\n      <div class=\"sv-constellation-rail\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <span class=\"sv-node\"><i class=\"fas fa-user-plus\"></i></span>\r\n        <span class=\"sv-node center\"><i class=\"fas fa-user-graduate\"></i></span>\r\n        <span class=\"sv-node\"><i class=\"fas fa-users-cog\"></i></span>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 1: THE RIGHT PEOPLE MAKE THE DIFFERENCE (OFFWHITE) -->\r\n<section class=\"staff-difference-sec\" id=\"people-difference\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap difference-split\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"difference-copy anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">People-First Hospitality</span>\r\n      <h2>The Right People Make <em>the Difference.</em></h2>\r\n      <p>Great hospitality is not just about the space or the food; it is about the people who bring the entire experience together. Having the right employees in the right roles plays an important part in maintaining service quality, operational efficiency, and customer satisfaction.</p>\r\n      <p>Whether you are launching a new restaurant, expanding an existing outlet, or improving your current team, we help you establish a workforce that supports your business goals and delivers consistent hospitality standards.</p>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"team-callout\">\r\n        <span>Capable &amp; Confident Teams</span>\r\n        <p>“From identifying suitable talent to developing essential service skills, we help create capable teams that understand your business standards, work efficiently, and contribute to memorable guest experiences.”</p>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Right Column: Single Image with Shapes (No Text) -->\r\n    <div class=\"difference-arch-stage anim-base anim-fade-left delay-100\">\r\n      <svg class=\"das-rings-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 220\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#C4161C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"98\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 6\" opacity=\"0.55\" />\r\n        <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"70\" opacity=\"0.65\" />\r\n      </svg>\r\n      <div class=\"das-navy-slab\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"das-wireframe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"das-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"das-backdrop-img\">\r\n        <figure class=\"cr-figure\">\r\n          <img src=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/wp-content/themes/artha-child-theme/assets/images/artha-hospitality-staffing-overview.jpg\" alt=\"Hospitality staff collaborating to deliver exceptional guest service\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n          <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">Hospitality staff collaborating to deliver exceptional guest service</figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 2: OUR STAFFING SUPPORT SERVICES (DEEP ARCHITECTURAL NAVY #0D2244 - 5-ZONE BLUEPRINT MATRIX) -->\r\n<section class=\"services-matrix-sec\" id=\"staffing-services\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"head-center anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Workforce Excellence</span>\r\n      <h2>Our Staffing Support Services.</h2>\r\n      <p>End-to-end human resource and team development solutions tailored to the daily realities of hospitality operations.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"staff-blueprint anim-base anim-fade-up delay-100\">\r\n      <!-- Top Row: 01 & 02 -->\r\n      <div class=\"sb-row-top\">\r\n        <!-- 01. Recruitment & Talent Selection -->\r\n        <article class=\"sb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"sb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"sb-num-pill\">01. Recruitment &amp; Talent Selection</span>\r\n            <span class=\"sb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-user-check\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"sb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Recruitment &amp; Talent Selection</h3>\r\n            <p>We help identify and recruit suitable candidates based on your business requirements, required skill sets, experience, and organisational needs.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 02. Staff Training & Development -->\r\n        <article class=\"sb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"sb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"sb-num-pill\">02. Staff Training &amp; Development</span>\r\n            <span class=\"sb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-chalkboard-teacher\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"sb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Staff Training &amp; Development</h3>\r\n            <p>We support employee development through structured training focused on customer service, communication, workplace responsibilities, and hospitality standards.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Bottom Row: 03, 04 & 05 -->\r\n      <div class=\"sb-row-bottom\">\r\n        <!-- 03. Role & Responsibility Management -->\r\n        <article class=\"sb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"sb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"sb-num-pill\">03. Role &amp; Responsibility</span>\r\n            <span class=\"sb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-sitemap\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"sb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Role &amp; Responsibility Management</h3>\r\n            <p>We help establish clear job roles, responsibilities, and reporting structures so that every team member understands their contribution to daily operations.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 04. Service Standards & Performance -->\r\n        <article class=\"sb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"sb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"sb-num-pill\">04. Standards &amp; Performance</span>\r\n            <span class=\"sb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-award\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"sb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Service Standards &amp; Performance</h3>\r\n            <p>We encourage consistent service practices and performance standards to help employees deliver efficient, professional, and guest-focused service.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 05. Team Coordination & Management -->\r\n        <article class=\"sb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"sb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"sb-num-pill\">05. Team Coordination</span>\r\n            <span class=\"sb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-users\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"sb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Team Coordination &amp; Management</h3>\r\n            <p>We focus on improving teamwork, communication, and coordination between departments to support smooth daily operations and a productive working environment.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 3: OUR APPROACH TO STAFFING SUPPORT (LIGHT SLATE-BLUE TINT #EDF2F8 - 4 CARDS) -->\r\n<section class=\"approach-sec\" id=\"staffing-approach\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"head-center anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Our Process</span>\r\n      <h2>Our Approach to Staffing Support.</h2>\r\n      <p>A structured four-step methodology to recruit, train, and align your hospitality workforce for lasting operational success.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"approach-grid\">\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-100\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-clipboard-list\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Understanding Your Staffing Needs</h3>\r\n        <p>We begin by understanding your business concept, operational requirements, team structure, and workforce needs.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-200\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-user-plus\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Recruiting the Right Talent</h3>\r\n        <p>We help identify suitable candidates for the required positions, ensuring that recruitment aligns with your business expectations.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-300\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-user-graduate\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Developing Skills Through Training</h3>\r\n        <p>We focus on preparing employees with the necessary knowledge, service skills, and professional conduct required in the hospitality industry.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-400\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-hands-helping\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Supporting Effective Team Management</h3>\r\n        <p>We help establish clear responsibilities, encourage team coordination, and promote consistent service delivery across your operations.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 4: CTA (WARM GOLD CHAMPAGNE #EFE3C6) -->\r\n<section class=\"cta\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap cta-inner anim-base anim-zoom-in\">\r\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\">Let\'s Build a Stronger Hospitality Team Together.</span>\r\n    <h2>Great Hospitality Starts With Great People.</h2>\r\n    <p>Your team is the foundation of your guests\' experience. With the right people, proper training, and effective management, your business can deliver better service and build lasting customer relationships.</p>\r\n    <p>Let Artha Hospitality Management help you develop a capable, confident, and service-oriented workforce.</p>\r\n    <div class=\"cta-btns\">\r\n      <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/artha-hospitality-contact-us/\" class=\"btn btn-light\">Partner With Artha <span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a>\r\n      <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/artha-hospitality-contact-us/#contact-form-section\" class=\"btn btn-outline-light\">Get in Touch</a>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n</article>', 'Staffing Support', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'staffing-support', '', '', '2026-11-26 10:21:39', '2026-11-26 10:21:39', '', 0, 'http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/?page_id=58', 0, 'page', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES(59, 1, '2026-11-26 10:20:31', '2026-11-26 10:20:31', '<article>\r\n<!-- NEW 75VH STAFFING SUPPORT CONSTELLATION ARCH HERO SECTION -->\r\n<section class=\"staff-hero\" id=\"staffing-top\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap staff-hero-grid\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- Left Column: Editorial Copy & CTAs -->\r\n    <div class=\"staff-hero-copy anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <div class=\"service-meta-row\">\r\n        <nav class=\"crumb-badge\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\r\n          <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/\">Home</a>\r\n          <span class=\"sep\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i></span>\r\n          <a href=\"#\">Services</a>\r\n          <span class=\"sep\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i></span>\r\n          <span class=\"curr\">Staffing Support</span>\r\n        </nav>\r\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">Staffing Support</span>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <h1>Building Strong Teams. <em>Delivering Exceptional Hospitality.</em></h1>\r\n      <p>Behind every successful hospitality business is a skilled, motivated, and well-managed team. At Artha Hospitality Management, we support hospitality businesses in building the right workforce through effective recruitment, staff training, and employee management.</p>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"staff-hero-actions\">\r\n        <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/artha-hospitality-contact-us/\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Partner With Artha <span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a>\r\n        <a href=\"#staffing-services\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Our Staffing Services</a> \r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Right Column: Sculpted Pill-Oval Portrait Stage with Connected Team Constellation (No Text) -->\r\n    <div class=\"staff-visual-stage anim-base anim-fade-left delay-100\">\r\n      <div class=\"sv-navy-wing-tl\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"sv-navy-wing-br\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"sv-gold-halo\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"sv-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"sv-main-portrait\">\r\n        <figure class=\"cr-figure\">\r\n          <img src=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/wp-content/themes/artha-child-theme/assets/images/artha-hospitality-staffing-hero.jpg\" alt=\"Skilled and motivated hospitality team in professional attire\" loading=\"eager\">\r\n          <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">Skilled and motivated hospitality team in professional attire</figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- 3-Node Connected Team Constellation Rail (Icons Only, No Text) -->\r\n      <div class=\"sv-constellation-rail\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <span class=\"sv-node\"><i class=\"fas fa-user-plus\"></i></span>\r\n        <span class=\"sv-node center\"><i class=\"fas fa-user-graduate\"></i></span>\r\n        <span class=\"sv-node\"><i class=\"fas fa-users-cog\"></i></span>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 1: THE RIGHT PEOPLE MAKE THE DIFFERENCE (OFFWHITE) -->\r\n<section class=\"staff-difference-sec\" id=\"people-difference\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap difference-split\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"difference-copy anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">People-First Hospitality</span>\r\n      <h2>The Right People Make <em>the Difference.</em></h2>\r\n      <p>Great hospitality is not just about the space or the food; it is about the people who bring the entire experience together. Having the right employees in the right roles plays an important part in maintaining service quality, operational efficiency, and customer satisfaction.</p>\r\n      <p>Whether you are launching a new restaurant, expanding an existing outlet, or improving your current team, we help you establish a workforce that supports your business goals and delivers consistent hospitality standards.</p>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"team-callout\">\r\n        <span>Capable &amp; Confident Teams</span>\r\n        <p>“From identifying suitable talent to developing essential service skills, we help create capable teams that understand your business standards, work efficiently, and contribute to memorable guest experiences.”</p>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Right Column: Single Image with Shapes (No Text) -->\r\n    <div class=\"difference-arch-stage anim-base anim-fade-left delay-100\">\r\n      <svg class=\"das-rings-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 220\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#C4161C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"98\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 6\" opacity=\"0.55\" />\r\n        <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"70\" opacity=\"0.65\" />\r\n      </svg>\r\n      <div class=\"das-navy-slab\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"das-wireframe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"das-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"das-backdrop-img\">\r\n        <figure class=\"cr-figure\">\r\n          <img src=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/wp-content/themes/artha-child-theme/assets/images/artha-hospitality-staffing-overview.jpg\" alt=\"Hospitality staff collaborating to deliver exceptional guest service\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n          <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">Hospitality staff collaborating to deliver exceptional guest service</figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 2: OUR STAFFING SUPPORT SERVICES (DEEP ARCHITECTURAL NAVY #0D2244 - 5-ZONE BLUEPRINT MATRIX) -->\r\n<section class=\"services-matrix-sec\" id=\"staffing-services\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"head-center anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Workforce Excellence</span>\r\n      <h2>Our Staffing Support Services.</h2>\r\n      <p>End-to-end human resource and team development solutions tailored to the daily realities of hospitality operations.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"staff-blueprint anim-base anim-fade-up delay-100\">\r\n      <!-- Top Row: 01 & 02 -->\r\n      <div class=\"sb-row-top\">\r\n        <!-- 01. Recruitment & Talent Selection -->\r\n        <article class=\"sb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"sb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"sb-num-pill\">01. Recruitment &amp; Talent Selection</span>\r\n            <span class=\"sb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-user-check\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"sb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Recruitment &amp; Talent Selection</h3>\r\n            <p>We help identify and recruit suitable candidates based on your business requirements, required skill sets, experience, and organisational needs.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 02. Staff Training & Development -->\r\n        <article class=\"sb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"sb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"sb-num-pill\">02. Staff Training &amp; Development</span>\r\n            <span class=\"sb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-chalkboard-teacher\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"sb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Staff Training &amp; Development</h3>\r\n            <p>We support employee development through structured training focused on customer service, communication, workplace responsibilities, and hospitality standards.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Bottom Row: 03, 04 & 05 -->\r\n      <div class=\"sb-row-bottom\">\r\n        <!-- 03. Role & Responsibility Management -->\r\n        <article class=\"sb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"sb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"sb-num-pill\">03. Role &amp; Responsibility</span>\r\n            <span class=\"sb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-sitemap\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"sb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Role &amp; Responsibility Management</h3>\r\n            <p>We help establish clear job roles, responsibilities, and reporting structures so that every team member understands their contribution to daily operations.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 04. Service Standards & Performance -->\r\n        <article class=\"sb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"sb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"sb-num-pill\">04. Standards &amp; Performance</span>\r\n            <span class=\"sb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-award\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"sb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Service Standards &amp; Performance</h3>\r\n            <p>We encourage consistent service practices and performance standards to help employees deliver efficient, professional, and guest-focused service.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 05. Team Coordination & Management -->\r\n        <article class=\"sb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"sb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"sb-num-pill\">05. Team Coordination</span>\r\n            <span class=\"sb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-users\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"sb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Team Coordination &amp; Management</h3>\r\n            <p>We focus on improving teamwork, communication, and coordination between departments to support smooth daily operations and a productive working environment.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 3: OUR APPROACH TO STAFFING SUPPORT (LIGHT SLATE-BLUE TINT #EDF2F8 - 4 CARDS) -->\r\n<section class=\"approach-sec\" id=\"staffing-approach\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"head-center anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Our Process</span>\r\n      <h2>Our Approach to Staffing Support.</h2>\r\n      <p>A structured four-step methodology to recruit, train, and align your hospitality workforce for lasting operational success.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"approach-grid\">\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-100\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-clipboard-list\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Understanding Your Staffing Needs</h3>\r\n        <p>We begin by understanding your business concept, operational requirements, team structure, and workforce needs.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-200\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-user-plus\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Recruiting the Right Talent</h3>\r\n        <p>We help identify suitable candidates for the required positions, ensuring that recruitment aligns with your business expectations.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-300\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-user-graduate\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Developing Skills Through Training</h3>\r\n        <p>We focus on preparing employees with the necessary knowledge, service skills, and professional conduct required in the hospitality industry.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-400\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-hands-helping\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Supporting Effective Team Management</h3>\r\n        <p>We help establish clear responsibilities, encourage team coordination, and promote consistent service delivery across your operations.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 4: CTA (WARM GOLD CHAMPAGNE #EFE3C6) -->\r\n<section class=\"cta\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap cta-inner anim-base anim-zoom-in\">\r\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\">Let\'s Build a Stronger Hospitality Team Together.</span>\r\n    <h2>Great Hospitality Starts With Great People.</h2>\r\n    <p>Your team is the foundation of your guests\' experience. With the right people, proper training, and effective management, your business can deliver better service and build lasting customer relationships.</p>\r\n    <p>Let Artha Hospitality Management help you develop a capable, confident, and service-oriented workforce.</p>\r\n    <div class=\"cta-btns\">\r\n      <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/artha-hospitality-contact-us/\" class=\"btn btn-light\">Partner With Artha <span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a>\r\n      <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/artha-hospitality-contact-us/#contact-form-section\" class=\"btn btn-outline-light\">Get in Touch</a>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n</article>', 'Staffing Support', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '58-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-11-26 10:20:31', '2026-11-26 10:20:31', '', 58, 'http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/?p=59', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES(60, 1, '2026-11-27 09:22:04', '2026-11-27 09:22:04', '', 'Careers', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'careers', '', '', '2026-11-27 12:06:31', '2026-11-27 12:06:31', '', 0, 'http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/?page_id=60', 0, 'page', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES(62, 1, '2026-11-26 10:24:34', '2026-11-26 10:24:34', '<article>\r\n<!-- NEW 75VH PROCUREMENT NETWORK, VERIFIED SEAL & SUPPLY-CHAIN HERO SECTION -->\r\n<section class=\"vendor-hero\" id=\"vendor-top\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap vendor-hero-grid\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- Left Column: Editorial Copy & CTAs -->\r\n    <div class=\"vendor-hero-copy anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <div class=\"service-meta-row\">\r\n        <nav class=\"crumb-badge\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\r\n          <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/\">Home</a>\r\n          <span class=\"sep\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i></span>\r\n          <a href=\"#\">Services</a>\r\n          <span class=\"sep\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i></span>\r\n          <span class=\"curr\">Vendor &amp; Purchase Advice</span>\r\n        </nav>\r\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">Procurement &amp; Supply Chain</span>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <h1>The Right Suppliers. <em>Smarter Purchasing Decisions.</em></h1>\r\n      <p>Reliable suppliers and informed purchasing decisions play an important role in the success of every hospitality business. At Artha Hospitality Management, we help businesses identify dependable vendors and make cost-effective purchasing decisions while maintaining the quality of products and services.</p>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"vendor-hero-actions\">\r\n        <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/contact-us\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Partner With Artha <span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a>\r\n        <a href=\"#focus-areas\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Our Advisory Focus Areas</a>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Right Column: Interlocking Procurement Dual-Stage, Supply Network Arc & Partnership Seal (No Text) -->\r\n    <div class=\"vendor-network-stage anim-base anim-fade-left delay-100\">\r\n      <svg class=\"vn-route-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 600 500\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <path d=\"M 40 430 C 140 80, 440 40, 560 190\" stroke=\"#C4161C\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 6\" opacity=\"0.7\" />\r\n        <circle cx=\"560\" cy=\"190\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#C4161C\" />\r\n        <circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"430\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#1A1718\" />\r\n      </svg>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"vn-navy-backing\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Primary Sculpted Procurement & Hospitality Window -->\r\n      <div class=\"vn-primary-frame\">\r\n        <figure class=\"cr-figure\">\r\n          <img src=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/wp-content/themes/artha-child-theme/assets/images/artha-hospitality-vendor-hero-primary.jpg\" alt=\"Premium hospitality equipment, ingredients, and supplier quality standards\" loading=\"eager\">\r\n          <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">Premium hospitality equipment, ingredients, and supplier quality standards</figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Secondary Overlapping Product & Supply Window -->\r\n      <div class=\"vn-secondary-frame\">\r\n        <figure class=\"cr-figure\">\r\n          <img src=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/wp-content/themes/artha-child-theme/assets/images/artha-hospitality-vendor-hero-secondary.jpg\" alt=\"Curated hospitality dining supplies, tableware, and procurement details\" loading=\"eager\">\r\n          <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">Curated hospitality dining supplies, tableware, and procurement details</figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Gold Supplier Partnership Handshake Seal (Center Overlap, Icon Only) -->\r\n      <div class=\"vn-partner-seal\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <i class=\"fas fa-handshake\"></i>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- 3-Node Supply Chain Dock (Delivery, Quality Verification, Smart Value - Icons Only) -->\r\n      <div class=\"vn-supply-dock\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <span><i class=\"fas fa-truck\"></i></span>\r\n        <span><i class=\"fas fa-clipboard-check\"></i></span>\r\n        <span><i class=\"fas fa-tags\"></i></span>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 1: BUILDING RELIABLE SUPPLIER PARTNERSHIPS (OFFWHITE) -->\r\n<section class=\"vendor-overview-sec\" id=\"vendor-overview\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap overview-split\">\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"overview-copy anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Dependable Procurement</span>\r\n      <h2>Building Reliable <em>Supplier Partnerships.</em></h2>\r\n      <p>The quality and consistency of your hospitality operations often depend on the suppliers you work with. Choosing the right vendors can help maintain product standards, ensure timely deliveries, and prevent unnecessary interruptions to daily operations.</p>\r\n      <p>Whether you are setting up a new restaurant, managing an established hotel, or expanding your hospitality business, we help you make informed vendor and purchasing decisions that align with your operational requirements and business objectives.</p>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"vendor-callout\">\r\n        <span>Quality &amp; Cost Alignment</span>\r\n        <p>“From evaluating supplier options and comparing prices to assessing product quality and purchase requirements, we focus on helping you establish reliable procurement practices that support smooth operations and better cost management.”</p>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- Right Column: Single Image with Shapes (No Text) -->\r\n    <div class=\"overview-arch-stage anim-base anim-fade-left delay-100\">\r\n      <svg class=\"oas-rings-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 220 220\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#C4161C\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n        <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"98\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 6\" opacity=\"0.55\" />\r\n        <circle cx=\"110\" cy=\"110\" r=\"70\" opacity=\"0.65\" />\r\n      </svg>\r\n      <div class=\"oas-navy-slab\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"oas-wireframe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n      <div class=\"oas-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"oas-backdrop-img\">\r\n        <figure class=\"cr-figure\">\r\n          <img src=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/wp-content/themes/artha-child-theme/assets/images/artha-hospitality-vendor-overview.jpg\" alt=\"Reliable hospitality vendor sourcing and quality purchasing\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n          <figcaption class=\"cr-only\">Reliable hospitality vendor sourcing and quality purchasing</figcaption>\r\n        </figure>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 2: OUR VENDOR & PURCHASE ADVISORY FOCUS AREAS (DEEP ARCHITECTURAL NAVY #0D2244 - 5-ZONE BLUEPRINT MATRIX) -->\r\n<section class=\"vendor-focus-sec\" id=\"focus-areas\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"head-center anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Procurement Advisory</span>\r\n      <h2>Our Vendor &amp; Purchase Advisory Focus Areas.</h2>\r\n      <p>Structured vendor identification, rigorous quality evaluation, and value-driven purchasing coordination for hospitality establishments.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"vendor-blueprint anim-base anim-fade-up delay-100\">\r\n      <!-- Top Row: 01 & 02 -->\r\n      <div class=\"vb-row-top\">\r\n        <!-- 01. Vendor Identification & Selection -->\r\n        <article class=\"vb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"vb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"vb-num-pill\">01. Vendor Identification</span>\r\n            <span class=\"vb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-search-location\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"vb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Vendor Identification &amp; Selection</h3>\r\n            <p>We help identify potential suppliers based on your business requirements, product specifications, reliability, and ability to meet your operational needs.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 02. Supplier Evaluation -->\r\n        <article class=\"vb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"vb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"vb-num-pill\">02. Supplier Evaluation</span>\r\n            <span class=\"vb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-clipboard-check\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"vb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Supplier Evaluation</h3>\r\n            <p>We focus on evaluating vendors based on product quality, pricing, consistency, service standards, and delivery capabilities to support informed selection decisions.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Bottom Row: 03, 04 & 05 -->\r\n      <div class=\"vb-row-bottom\">\r\n        <!-- 03. Cost-Effective Purchasing -->\r\n        <article class=\"vb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"vb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"vb-num-pill\">03. Cost-Effective Purchasing</span>\r\n            <span class=\"vb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-tags\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"vb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Cost-Effective Purchasing</h3>\r\n            <p>We guide purchasing decisions by considering product requirements, available options, pricing, and overall value, helping minimise unnecessary expenditure.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 04. Product Quality & Specifications -->\r\n        <article class=\"vb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"vb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"vb-num-pill\">04. Quality &amp; Specifications</span>\r\n            <span class=\"vb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-medal\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"vb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Product Quality &amp; Specifications</h3>\r\n            <p>We emphasise the importance of selecting products and materials that meet your required quality standards, specifications, and operational expectations.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- 05. Procurement & Supply Coordination -->\r\n        <article class=\"vb-cell\">\r\n          <div class=\"vb-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"vb-num-pill\">05. Supply Coordination</span>\r\n            <span class=\"vb-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-truck-loading\"></i></span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"vb-body\">\r\n            <h3>Procurement &amp; Supply Coordination</h3>\r\n            <p>We focus on supporting organised purchasing practices and reliable supplier coordination to help maintain consistent availability of essential products and resources.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 3: OUR APPROACH TO VENDOR SELECTION & PURCHASE ADVICE (LIGHT SLATE-BLUE TINT #EDF2F8 - 4 CARDS) -->\r\n<section class=\"approach-sec\" id=\"vendor-approach\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"head-center anim-base anim-fade-right\">\r\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Our Process</span>\r\n      <h2>Our Approach to Vendor Selection &amp; Purchase Advice.</h2>\r\n      <p>A systematic four-step framework to align your operational requirements with dependable suppliers and smarter purchasing value.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"approach-grid\">\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-100\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-list-ul\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Understanding Your Requirements</h3>\r\n        <p>We begin by understanding your hospitality concept, operational needs, product specifications, purchasing requirements, and budget considerations.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-200\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-truck\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Identifying Suitable Vendors</h3>\r\n        <p>We explore potential suppliers and vendors who can meet your business requirements in terms of quality, pricing, reliability, and service.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-300\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-balance-scale-right\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Evaluating &amp; Comparing Options</h3>\r\n        <p>We help assess available purchasing options, compare supplier offerings, and evaluate overall value before making decisions.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n\r\n      <article class=\"approach-card anim-base anim-fade-up delay-400\">\r\n        <span class=\"ac-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"fas fa-handshake\"></i></span>\r\n        <h3>Supporting Smarter Purchases</h3>\r\n        <p>We encourage informed purchasing practices and dependable supplier relationships that support product consistency, cost control, and uninterrupted daily operations.</p>\r\n      </article>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- SECTION 4: CTA (WARM GOLD CHAMPAGNE #EFE3C6) -->\r\n<section class=\"cta\">\r\n  <div class=\"wrap cta-inner anim-base anim-zoom-in\">\r\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\">Let\'s Make Every Purchase Count.</span>\r\n    <h2>Better Suppliers. Smarter Investments. Smoother Operations.</h2>\r\n    <p>The right purchasing decisions can make a meaningful difference to your business performance. Reliable vendors, consistent product quality, and effective cost management help create a stronger foundation for everyday hospitality operations.</p>\r\n    <p>Let Artha Hospitality Management help you make confident purchasing decisions and establish supplier relationships that support your business goals.</p>\r\n    <div class=\"cta-btns\">\r\n      <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/contact-us\" class=\"btn btn-light\">Partner With Artha <span class=\"arrow\">↗</span></a>\r\n      <a href=\"http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/contact-us#contact-form-section\" class=\"btn btn-outline-light\">Get in Touch</a>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n</article>', 'Vendor Selection & Purchase Support', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'vendor-selection-purchase-support', '', '', '2026-11-26 10:28:53', '2026-11-26 10:28:53', '', 0, 'http://localhost/artha-hospitality-management/?page_id=62', 0, 'page', '', 0);
